        value: "[{\"question\":\"This workspace runs a live Vite web preview rather than native Expo/iOS/Android build tools. How should we build Phase 1?\",\"options\":[\"(Recommended) Live React Web/PWA here with Expo-portable core\",\"Exportable Expo React Native codebase for local EAS builds\",\"Both: live Web/PWA app plus Expo config blueprint\"]},{\"question\":\"Cloud Storage requires Firebase Blaze (pay-as-you-go with free allowances). Which Stage 0 storage posture do you prefer?\",\"options\":[\"(Recommended) Spark free tier with Local-Only Vault first\",\"Enable Blaze with budget alerts and Cloud Storage\",\"Use AI Studio provisioned Firestore for web testing\"]},{\"question\":\"Which primary language and default currency should Stage 0 optimize first while keeping EN, AR, and Kurdish Sorani RTL ready?\",\"options\":[\"(Recommended) English UI with IQD and USD dual currency\",\"Arabic RTL first with IQD and USD\",\"Kurdish Sorani RTL first with IQD and USD\"]},{\"question\":\"How should client-side E2E encryption work for your sensitive Vault documents and locked notes?\",\"options\":[\"(Recommended) Opt-in per folder/note with recovery key\",\"Always-on E2E for entire Document Vault\",\"Defer E2E to Phase 5 and use biometric lock first\"]},{\"question\":\"What default visual direction should LifeOS use across its light, dark, and AMOLED themes?\",\"options\":[\"(Recommended) Calm slate and emerald Material You + iOS polish\",\"Warm stone and amber editorial minimalism\",\"High-contrast obsidian AMOLED productivity cockpit\"]}]"
