    thinking: "**Loading Domain References**\n\nI\'m currently focused on loading the Two-Hop Domain References from `frontend-design`. Specifically, I\'m targeting the \"SaaS & Dashboards\" domain, which covers a multi-module productivity cockpit, including debts/finance ledgers, a task planner, analytics, tables, and sidebar navigation. I will load the references from the file `references/3_saas_dashboard.md`.\n\n\n"
