              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Server-Only Entitlements**: `/users/{userId}/entitlements/{entitlementId}` is strictly read-only for the authenticated owner (`allow create, update, delete: if false;`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Immutable Identity & Audit Fields**: `uid` must equal `request.auth.uid` on create and remain immutable on update. `createdAt` must equal `request.time` on create and remain immutable on update. `updatedAt` must equal `request.time` on every write."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **Monotonic Daily AI Quota**: `/users/{userId}/aiUsage/{dayKey}` forbids deletes, requires `dayKey` matching `^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$`, initializes `requestCount == 1` on create, and only permits `requestCount == existing().requestCount + 1` on update."
