    thinking: "**Initiating Rule Deployment**\n\nI\'m currently focused on linting `firestore.rules` using ESLint and deploying it via `rpc_action`. The `service_name` will be \"fax\" and the `method_name` will be \"DeployRules\". Concurrently, I\'m working on setting up a CI workflow file (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`) and a `server.ts` file, an Express server with Vite middleware and a hardened `/api/ai/complete` proxy, using `@google/genai`.\n\n\n**Refining CSS Structure**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in designing `src/index.css`, making sure it aligns with frontend-design standards. I\'m focusing on Tailwind imports, a dark mode custom variant following the critical frontend-design rule, and defining semantic CSS variables. I am meticulously crafting variables for Light, Dark, and AMOLED themes, establishing the visual foundation for the application.\n\n\n"
