  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Architectural Plans**\n\nI\'ve successfully deployed the ruleset, and I\'m moving on to construct the next architectural layer in parallel. I\'m focusing on `src/core/schemas/userProfileSchema.ts`. My goal is to ensure shared Zod schemas strictly match the `firebase-blueprint.json` structure for consistency.\n\n\n**Implementing Core Validation**\n\nI\'m now deep in implementing robust validation synchronicity, meticulously defining `maxLength`, `enum`, and `pattern` constraints. Next on my list is the tri-lingual `i18next` setup for English, Arabic, and Kurdish Sorani within `src/core/i18n/i18n.ts`, including the automatic direction and language synchronization. I\'ve also constructed a provider-agnostic `LLMProvider` interface and a `ServerProxyLLMProvider`, complete with caching, privacy checks, and error handling for LLM interactions in `src/core/ai/llmProvider.ts`. Finally, I\'ve got the Firebase Client (`src/data/firebase/firebaseClient.ts`) initialized.\n\n\n**Constructing Platform Abstractions**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing unified, platform-agnostic repository interfaces within `src/data/repositories/interfaces.ts`, including `AuthRepository`, `UserProfileRepository`, and others. This separation ensures the UI never interacts directly with Firebase. I\'ve also begun implementation within `src/data/repositories/firebaseWebAdapter.ts`, which includes Google Sign-In with popup, user profile updates, and real-time listeners. I\'m also implementing monotonic daily quota tracking and a local fallback system. Finally, I\'ve got a UI state store constructed for ephemeral UI state.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Offline UX**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the initial user experience for unauthenticated and offline scenarios. The plan is to render a clean \"Local Offline Mode\" of the LifeOS workspace immediately. This includes a clear call to action for signing in with Google, and non-blocking access to settings, theming, local vault setup, and the AI command palette. I\'m prioritizing user agency and immediate usability.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "DZsEa5a1IPHW_uMPqtjE4A4"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7975067746906602653"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { z } from \'zod\';\\n\\nexport const LocaleSchema = z.enum([\'en\', \'ar\', \'ckb\']);\\nexport const ThemeSchema = z.enum([\'light\', \'dark\', \'amoled\']);\\nexport const CurrencySchema = z.enum([\'IQD\', \'USD\', \'EUR\']);\\nexport const VaultStorageModeSchema = z.enum([\'local_only\', \'cloud_private\']);\\n\\nexport const AiModuleTogglesSchema = z.object({\\n  debts: z.boolean().default(true),\\n  reminders: z.boolean().default(true),\\n  planner: z.boolean().default(true),\\n  notes: z.boolean().default(true),\\n  vault: z.boolean().default(false), // Disabled by default under Privacy Gate\\n  habits: z.boolean().default(true),\\n  finance: z.boolean().default(true),\\n  assistant: z.boolean().default(true),\\n});\\n\\nexport type AiModuleToggles = z.infer<typeof AiModuleTogglesSchema>;\\n\\nexport const UserProfileSchema = z.object({\\n  uid: z.string().min(1).max(128).regex(/^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\-]+$/),\\n  displayName: z.string().min(1).max(100),\\n  email: z.string().email().max(254).optional(),\\n  locale: LocaleSchema,\\n  theme: ThemeSchema,\\n  primaryCurrency: CurrencySchema,\\n  secondaryCurrency: CurrencySchema,\\n  vaultStorageMode: VaultStorageModeSchema,\\n  aiGlobalEnabled: z.boolean(),\\n  aiModuleToggles: AiModuleTogglesSchema.optional(),\\n  analyticsConsent: z.boolean(),\\n  aiPrivacyNoticeAccepted: z.boolean(),\\n  e2eConfigured: z.boolean(),\\n  e2eSalt: z.string().max(128).optional(),\\n  e2eVerifier: z.string().max(256).optional(),\\n  quietHoursStart: z.string().regex(/^([01]\\\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\\\d$/).optional(),\\n  quietHoursEnd: z.string().regex(/^([01]\\\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\\\d$/).optional(),\\n  version: z.number().int().min(1),\\n});\\n\\nexport type UserProfileData = z.infer<typeof UserProfileSchema>;\\n\\nexport const DEFAULT_AI_MODULE_TOGGLES: AiModuleToggles = {\\n  debts: true,\\n  reminders: true,\\n  planner: true,\\n  notes: true,\\n  vault: false,\\n  habits: true,\\n  finance: true,\\n  assistant: true,\\n};\\n\\nexport function createDefaultUserProfile(\\n  uid: string,\\n  displayName = \'Personal Workspace\',\\n  email?: string\\n): UserProfileData {\\n  return {\\n    uid,\\n    displayName: displayName.slice(0, 100) || \'Personal Workspace\',\\n    ...(email ? { email: email.slice(0, 254) } : {}),\\n    locale: \'en\',\\n    theme: \'light\',\\n    primaryCurrency: \'IQD\',\\n    secondaryCurrency: \'USD\',\\n    vaultStorageMode: \'local_only\',\\n    aiGlobalEnabled: true,\\n    aiModuleToggles: { ...DEFAULT_AI_MODULE_TOGGLES },\\n    analyticsConsent: false,\\n    aiPrivacyNoticeAccepted: false,\\n    e2eConfigured: false,\\n    quietHoursStart: \'22:30\',\\n    quietHoursEnd: \'07:00\',\\n    version: 1,\\n  };\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create shared Zod validation schemas synchronized with firebase-blueprint.json constraints.\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/core/schemas/userProfileSchema.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating shared Zod user profile schema\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create user profile schema\"}"
