rack money you lent or borrowed in IQD, USD, or EUR. Every calculation stays deterministic on-device.\',\\n        logPayment: \'Log Payment\',\\n        draftReminder: \'Draft Reminder\',\\n        details: \'Details\',\\n        remaining: \'Remaining\',\\n        ofPrincipal: \'of\',\\n        dueDate: \'Due\',\\n        noDueDate: \'No due date\',\\n        overdueDays: \'{{count}}d overdue\',\\n        repaymentScore: \'Repayment probability\',\\n        settledLocked: \'Settled \302\267 Locked\',\\n        personName: \'Person or Lender Name\',\\n        personPhone: \'Phone / WhatsApp (optional)\',\\n        direction: \'Direction\',\\n        amount: \'Amount\',\\n        currency: \'Currency\',\\n        category: \'Category\',\\n        aprLabel: \'Annual Interest APR % (optional)\',\\n        notesLabel: \'Notes (optional)\',\\n        saveDebt: \'Save Debt\',\\n        saveChanges: \'Save Changes\',\\n        aiParsePlaceholder: \'e.g. \\\"I lent Omar 250000 IQD for car repair due 2026-12-15\\\" or Arabic / Kurdish...\',\\n        aiParseBtn: \'Parse Draft\',\\n        aiDraftNotice: \'AI draft loaded \342\200\224 review all fields carefully before saving.\',\\n        payFullBtn: \'Full Remaining\',\\n        paymentMethod: \'Payment Method\',\\n        paymentDate: \'Payment Date\',\\n        confirmPayment: \'Record Payment\',\\n        reminderTitle: \'Draft Payment Reminder\',\\n        toneGentle: \'Gentle\',\\n        toneFirm: \'Firm\',\\n        toneFormal: \'Formal\',\\n        generateDraft: \'Generate Draft\',\\n        copyMessage: \'Copy Message\',\\n        openWhatsApp: \'WhatsApp\',\\n        snowball: \'Snowball (Smallest First)\',\\n        avalanche: \'Avalanche (Highest APR First)\',\\n        monthlyBudget: \'Monthly Payoff Budget\',\\n        monthsToFree: \'Months to Debt-Free\',\\n        estInterest: \'Estimated Interest\',\\n        interestSaved: \'Avalanche saves\',\\n        inflow: \'Expected Inflow\',\\n        outflow: \'