"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/core/debts/debtSchemas.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Debt Zod schemas and helpers\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create debtSchemas.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import { convertMinorUnits, type CurrencyCode } from \'../currency/currency\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  DEFAULT_FX_RATES_TO_IQD,\\\\n  getCrossRate,\\\\n  type DebtLedger,\\\\n  type DebtRecord,\\\\n  type DebtStatus,\\\\n  type FxRatesToIqd,\\\\n} from \'./debtSchemas\';\\\\n\\\\nexport const \\n<truncated 18842 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create deterministic Phase 2 Debts domain engine covering multi-currency aggregation, repayment probability, snowball/avalanche planner, 30/60/90-day forecast, settlement math, and CSV export.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/core/debts/debtEngine.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating deterministic Debts domain engine\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create debtEngine.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import test from \'node:test\';\\\\nimport assert from \'node:assert/strict\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  aggregateDebtMetrics,\\\\n  buildCashFlowForecast,\\\\n  buildPersonLedgerRollups,\\\\n  computeEffectiveStatus,\\\\n  computePaymentTransition,\\\\n  computePayoffPlan,\\\\n  estimateRepa\\n<truncated 7319 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add comprehensive unit tests for Phase 2 Debts domain engine, multi-currency math, probability scoring, payoff planner, forecast, and CSV safety.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/core/debts/debtEngine.test.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Debts domain unit tests\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create debtEngine.test.ts\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":212,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T20:49:01Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":2836,\"cache_read_tokens\":183927,\"output_tokens\":736,\"thinking\":\"**Refining Data Access**\\n\\nI\'m focusing on ensuring the data layer neatly handles both cloud Firestore\'s real-time mode (when authenticated) and local, offline operation. Currently, I\'m considering using repository interfaces for flexibility. I\'m prioritizing the implementation of Firebase Web adapter and local offline adapter. I\'m also working on debts AI routes.\\n\\n\\n**Structuring Data Subscriptions**\\n\\nI\'ve been working on a structured approach to data subscriptions using `onSnapshot` queries. I\'m focusing on\\n<truncated 318 bytes>\\nData Transitions**\\n\\nI\'m now integrating `deleteField()` effectively for optional field clearing. The `recordPayment` function is using a pure compute step followed by an atomic write batch. I\'m focusing on atomically appending payments, updating debt metadata, and updating debt ledgers. I\'m also refining the `deleteDebt` process to return a snapshot for clean undo operations. The new debt implementation uses a very similar system as the `DebtsRepository` interface for signed-out local-first device usage!\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":213,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T20:49:49Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":171502,\"cache_read_tokens\":15261,\"output_tokens\":717,\"thinking\":\"**Refining Server Architecture**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on the `/server.ts` file, designing the server-side debts AI endpoints. I\'m prioritizing clean design, and now working on the repository abstraction using interfaces like `/src/data/repositories/interfaces.ts` and `/src/data/repositories/debtsRepository.ts`. Lastly, the local/cloud debts store in `/src/hooks/useDebts.ts` is in progress.\\n\\n\\n**Adding AI Endpoints**\\n\\nI\'ve added two new endpoints. The first, `POST /api/ai/debts/parse`, parses natural langua\\n<truncated 299 bytes>\\n`.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing Data Strategies**\\n\\nI\'ve completed the implementation of both `FirebaseWebDebtsRepository` and `LocalStorageDebtsRepository` within `/src/data/repositories/debtsRepository.ts`. These repositories handle data persistence and real-time updates based on user sign-in status. Furthermore, I\'ve created the `useDebts` hook in `/src/hooks/useDebts.ts`, which seamlessly manages and switches between the two repositories, ensuring data consistency and reactivity. It handles editable FX rates too.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":214,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T20:50:29Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":166884,\"cache_read_tokens\":19879,\"output_tokens\":14082,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing New API Endpoints**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on building out the new server routes. I\'m leveraging Zod for robust data validation and Privacy-Gate for enforcement. I\'m working with `@google/genai` (specifically `gemini-4-hydrogen` and `gemini-3.1`) to ensure the routes are clean and well-defined.\\n\\n\\n**Defining New Server Routes**\\n\\nI\'ve finalized the design of two key API endpoints. The first, a `POST /api/ai/debts/parse`, will parse debt text in English, Arabic, or Kurdish Sorani. The second, `POST /api/ai/debts/draft-reminder`, will draft polite reminders in those languages. I\'m focusing on providing options for tone and tailoring messages.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add server-side privacy-gated AI endpoints /api/ai/debts/parse and /api/ai/debts/draft-reminder using @google/genai with Zod output validation.\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"285\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add /api/ai/debts/parse and /api/ai/debts/draft-reminder routes right after /api/ai/complete in server.ts.\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"    res.status(status).json({\\\\n      error:\\\\n        status === 429\\\\n          ? \'AI free-tier rate quota reached. Falling back to offline/non-AI mode.\'\\\\n          : \'AI service is temporarily unavailable. All offline LifeOS features continue working.\',\\\\n\\n<truncated 11170 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"273\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"    res.status(status).json({\\\\n      error:\\\\n        status === 429\\\\n          ? \'AI free-tier rate quota reached. Falling back to offline/non-AI mode.\'\\\\n          : \'AI service is temporarily unavailable. All offline LifeOS features continue working.\',\\\\n\\n<truncated 85 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/server.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding Phase 2 Debts AI endpoints to server.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add Debts AI endpoints to server.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import { z } from \'zod\';\\\\nimport type { CurrencyCode, SupportedLocale } from \'../currency/currency\';\\\\nimport { evaluatePrivacyGate } from \'./privacyGate\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  AIParsedDebtDraftSchema,\\\\n  type AIParsedDebtDraft,\\\\n  type DebtDirection,\\\\n} from \'../\\n<truncated 5098 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create client-side Debts AI wrapper behind Privacy Gate calling server-side /api/ai/debts/* routes.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/core/ai/debtsAiClient.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Debts AI client wrapper\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create debtsAiClient.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add DebtsRepository contract to repository interfaces so UI never talks to Firebase directly.\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"65\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Import Debt types and append DebtsRepository interface to interfaces.ts.\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"export interface LocalVaultStorageAdapter {\\\\n  listLocalEntries(): Promise<LocalVaultEntryMeta[]>;\\\\n  saveLocalEntry(meta: LocalVaultEntryMeta, payload: string): Promise<void>;\\\\n  removeLocalEntry(id: string): Promise<void>;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface DebtsRe\\n<truncated 1417 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"60\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"export interface LocalVaultStorageAdapter {\\\\n  listLocalEntries(): Promise<LocalVaultEntryMeta[]>;\\\\n  saveLocalEntry(meta: LocalVaultEntryMeta, payload: string): Promise<void>;\\\\n  removeLocalEntry(id: string): Promise<void>;\\\\n}\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/data/repositories/interfaces.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding DebtsRepository interface\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add DebtsRepository interface\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import {\\\\n  collection,\\\\n  deleteDoc,\\\\n  deleteField,\\\\n  doc,\\\\n  getDoc,\\\\n  getDocs,\\\\n  onSnapshot,\\\\n  orderBy,\\\\n  query,\\\\n  serverTimestamp,\\\\n  setDoc,\\\\n  Timestamp,\\\\n  updateDoc,\\\\n  where,\\\\n  writeBatch,\\\\n} from \'firebase/firestore\';\\\\nimport { db, handl\\n<truncated 23508 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Implement FirebaseWebDebtsRepository (Firestore real-time + atomic batches) and LocalOfflineDebtsRepository (zero-friction local offline persistence) behind DebtsRepository.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/data/repositories/debtsRepository.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Debts repositories (Firestore + Local)\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create debtsRepository.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  DEFAULT_FX_RATES_TO_IQD,\\\\n  type CreateDebtInput,\\\\n  type DebtLedger,\\\\n  type DebtPayment,\\\\n  type DebtRecord,\\\\n  type FxRatesToIqd,\\\\n  type RecordPaymentInput,\\\\n} from \'../core/debts/\\n<truncated 3222 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create useDebts hook bridging Firestore real-time listeners (authenticated) and offline local persistence (unauthenticated) with editable FX reference rates.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/hooks/useDebts.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating useDebts React hook\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create useDebts.ts\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":220,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T20:52:34Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":190233,\"cache_read_tokens\":15261,\"output_tokens\":722,\"thinking\":\"**Structuring UI Components**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on organizing the `/src/features/debts/ui/` directory. My goal is to create clean, modular UI components. I want each component to be focused on a single elevation, avoiding unnecessary pill badges and ensuring crisp 1px hairlines for visual clarity.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing RTL Support**\\n\\nI\'ve been working on integrating RTL support. I\'ve updated the `/src/core/i18n/i18n.ts` file with comprehensive translations for English, Arabic, and Kurdish Sorani for the `de\\n<truncated 190 bytes>\\nare layouts.\\n\\n\\n**Designing Analytics Tabs**\\n\\nI\'m now deep in the design of the analytics tabs within the debts module. I\'m focusing on the `DebtsAnalyticsTabs` component, specifically the individual tabs. I\'m prioritizing the `PeopleLedgerTab` which shows grouped, multi-currency rollups per person. The `PayoffPlannerTab` will provide a comparison of Snowball vs. Avalanche payoff strategies, with a monthly budget input. Finally, I\'m structuring a `CashFlowForecastTab` table to show inflow versus outflows.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":221,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T20:54:50Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":190233,\"cache_read_tokens\":15261,\"output_tokens\":16101,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing Debts UI**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on building the Phase 2 Debts Manager UI with modular components in `/src/features/debts/ui/`. I\'m starting by translating i18n keys for English, Arabic, and Kurdish Sorani, ensuring a solid foundation for multilingual support.\\n\\n\\n**Expanding Translations & UIs**\\n\\nI\'ve added extensive `debts.*` translations across English, Arabic, and Kurdish Sorani, ensuring full RTL support for every UI element. I\'m building the Add/Edit Debt modal now. It will include an \\\"A\\n<truncated 256 bytes>\\ngning New Modal & Detail**\\n\\nI\'m now implementing the multilingual AI Reminder Drafter modal, offering gentle, firm, or formal tones in English, Arabic, and Kurdish Sorani. It leverages the `/api/ai/debts/draft-reminder` endpoint and manages the daily AI quota. Users can inspect, edit, copy to clipboard, or open WhatsApp. Additionally, I\'m working on the DebtDetailDrawer to provide a comprehensive view of debts, including a repayment probability breakdown, an audit history, edit, and delete functionality.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"multi_replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"Description\":\"\\\"Add full English, Arabic, and Kurdish Sorani translations for Phase 2 Debts Manager and update phaseReady copy.\\\"\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add debts namespace translations to en, ar, and ckb locales and update phaseReady string in i18n.ts.\\\"\",\"ReplacementChunks\":\"[{\\\"AllowMultiple\\\":false,\\\"EndLine\\\":44,\\\"ReplacementContent\\\":\\\"        close: \'Close\',\\\\n        phaseReady: \'Phase 2 \302\267 Debts Active\',\\\\n        upcomingPhase: \'Scheduled in Phase {{phase}}\',\\\\n      },\\\",\\\"StartLine\\\":39,\\\"TargetContent\\\":\\\"        close: \'Close\',\\\\n \\n<truncated 14536 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/core/i18n/i18n.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding EN/AR/CKB translations for Debts Manager\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add Debts i18n keys\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { Sparkles, X, ShieldAlert } from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { useTranslation } from \'react-i18next\';\\\\nimport { fromMinorUnits, toMinorUnits, type CurrencyCode } from \'../../../core/currency/currenc\\n<truncated 19535 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create DebtFormModal with integer minor-unit conversion and confirmation-gated AI natural-language parser.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/features/debts/ui/DebtFormModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating DebtFormModal component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create DebtFormModal.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { CheckCircle2, X } from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { useTranslation } from \'react-i18next\';\\\\nimport { formatMoney, fromMinorUnits, toMinorUnits } from \'../../../core/currency/currency\';\\\\nimport { g\\n<truncated 9404 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create DebtPaymentModal supporting partial payments, full settlement, Iraq/Kurdistan payment methods, and live deterministic balance preview.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/features/debts/ui/DebtPaymentModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating DebtPaymentModal component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create DebtPaymentModal.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { Check, Copy, ExternalLink, Sparkles, X } from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { useTranslation } from \'react-i18next\';\\\\nimport { formatMoney, type SupportedLocale } from \'../../../core/currency/currenc\\n<truncated 11032 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create DebtReminderModal supporting EN/AR/Kurdish Sorani tone-controlled AI message drafting, editing, clipboard copy, and WhatsApp share link.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/features/debts/ui/DebtReminderModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating DebtReminderModal component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create DebtReminderModal.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":226,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T20:57:00Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":210647,\"cache_read_tokens\":15261,\"output_tokens\":16946,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Debt Features**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on feature implementation for debt management. The key areas under development are the detailed debt inspector with probability factors for repayments, an audit log, and editing/deleting functionalities. Also, I am working on the analytic panels for user-based data.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  Edit3,\\\\n  MessageSquareText,\\\\n  Trash2,\\\\n  X,\\\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { useTranslation } from \'react-i18next\';\\\\nimport { formatMoney } from \'../../../core/currency/c\\n<truncated 12056 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create DebtDetailDrawer displaying full balance progress, deterministic repayment probability factors, append-only payment history, and edit/delete actions.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/features/debts/ui/DebtDetailDrawer.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating DebtDetailDrawer component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create DebtDetailDrawer.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useMemo, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { ArrowRight } from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { useTranslation } from \'react-i18next\';\\\\nimport { formatMoney, toMinorUnits, type CurrencyCode } from \'../../../core/currency/currency\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  bu\\n<truncated 17918 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create modular analytics panels for Phase 2 Debts Manager: People Counterparty Rollup, Snowball vs Avalanche Payoff Planner, and 30/60/90-day Cash-Flow Forecast.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/s