T21:00:42Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":2202,\"cache_read_tokens\":248954,\"output_tokens\":401,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Include Phase 2 Debts unit tests and Firestore rules test suite in npm test script.\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"16\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add src/core/debts/debtEngine.test.ts and firestore.rules.test.ts to npm test.\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"    \\\\\\\"lint:rules\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"eslint firestore.rules\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"test\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"tsx --test src/core/currency/currency.test.ts src/core/ai/privacyGate.test.ts src/core/crypto/e2eCrypto.test.ts src/core/entitlements/entitlements.test.ts src/core/debts/debtEngine.test.ts f\\n<truncated 31 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"12\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"    \\\\\\\"lint:rules\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"eslint firestore.rules\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"test\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"tsx --test src/core/currency/currency.test.ts src/core/ai/privacyGate.test.ts src/core/crypto/e2eCrypto.test.ts src/core/entitlements/entitlements.test.ts\\\\\\\"\\\\n  },\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/package.json\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding Debts & rules tests to package.json\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update test script in package.json\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"restart_dev_server\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Restarting dev server with Phase 2 API routes\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart dev server\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":243,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T21:01:15Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":236792,\"cache_read_tokens\":15261,\"output_tokens\":327,\"thinking\":\"**Testing Debt Creation**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on comprehensive testing. I\'m running the full test suite now (`npm test`) alongside headless browser verification using `playwright-cli`. This specifically covers navigation to the \\\"Debts\\\" section on a desktop resolution (1440x900). Further, I\'m testing the ability to add a new \\\"owed_to_me\\\" debt in IQD currency, with a sample entry such as Omar Ali owing 250,000 IQD.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"npm test\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running full Phase 1 & Phase 2 test suite\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run full test suite\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":245,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T21:01:44Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":2393,\"cache_read_tokens\":251519,\"output_tokens\":82,\"thinking\":\"**Verifying E2E Functionality**\\n\\nI\'ve successfully run a suite of unit and security rule tests, all of which passed in a respectable 1.15 seconds. Now, I\'m moving on to a crucial end-to-end verification. I am using `playwright-cli` to simulate user interactions in headless Chromium, specifically testing interactive flows on both desktop and mobile resolutions to verify core functionalities. I\'m focusing on tasks like creating debts, recording payments, and verifying people data.\\n\\n\\n\"}\n{\"step_index\":246,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T21:02:17Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":238651,\"cache_read_tokens\":15261,\"output_tokens\":1439,\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Live Behavior**\\n\\nI\'ve got good news! The automated 22 unit and security rule tests are all green. Now, I\'m shifting focus to live, end-to-end testing with Playwright, verifying the Debts Manager\'s functionality in both desktop and mobile modes. I\'ll cover the creation of multi-currency debts, partial payments, and document opening.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"playwright-cli open http://localhost:3000 && playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && playwright-cli eval \\\\\\\"\\\\n(async () => {\\\\n  localStorage.removeItem(\'lifeos_local_debts_v1\');\\\\n  const wait = (ms) => new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, ms));\\\\n  const clickText = (s\\n<truncated 3701 bytes>\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running end-to-end Playwright verification of Debts Manager\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Verify Debts Manager in browser\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}"
