    thinking: "**Testing the Workflow**\n\nI\'m making good progress! I\'ve been reviewing the Debts Manager structure and it\'s quite clean. I\'m now planning to use a Playwright script with `playwright-cli run-code` to exercise the full interactive lifecycle. My first step is to open the \"Add Debt\" modal and add a debt for \"Karwan Ali\" with the details: Owed to Me, 450,000 IQD, and a due date in 12 days.\n\n\n"
