  planner_response {
    response: "Phase 2 (**Debts Manager**) is complete, verified, and live.\n\n### What Was Built\n- **Multi-Currency Debt Ledger (IQD / USD / EUR)**: Exact integer minor-unit storage and math with configurable reference FX rates (`1 USD = 1,500 IQD` default), real-time Firestore sync when signed in, and full offline local persistence when signed out.\n- **Partial & Full Payment Workflows**: Atomic batch recording of append-only payment audit entries, automatic status transitions (`active` \342\206\222 `partial` \342\206\222 `settled` or `overdue`), overpayment guards, settled-debt immutability, and delete-with-undo.\n- **Deterministic Intelligence Engine (On-Device)**:\n  - **Repayment Probability Score** with transparent factor breakdown based on historical on-time/late ratio, partial repayment progress, and overdue decay.\n  - **Snowball vs. Avalanche Payoff Planner** with live monthly budget simulation, payoff sequence table, months-to-debt-free, and exact interest-saved comparison.\n  - **30/60/90-Day Cash-Flow Forecast** bucketing overdue, 30-day, 60-day, 90-day, and flexible obligations into expected inflows vs. scheduled outflows.\n  - **People Ledger & Formula-Safe CSV Export** aggregating multi-currency balances and reliability history per counterparty.\n- **Privacy-Gated AI Helpers (Confirmation-First)**:\n  - **AI Quick Entry Parser** extracting structured debt drafts from natural English, Arabic, or Kurdish Sorani sentences into the editable form preview (never auto-writing).\n  - **Multilingual Reminder Drafter** generating gentle, firm, or formal WhatsApp/SMS messages in English, Arabic, or Kurdish Sorani with one-tap copy and direct WhatsApp/SMS links.\n- **Hardened Security Rules & Home Integration**: Deployed updated Eight-Pillar Firestore rules enforcing ownership, action-split updates, and append-only payment logs; wired live Net Debt Position into the Home KPI strip and daily briefing.\n\n### Verification\n- **Tests**: 20/20 unit tests passing (debt domain math, multi-currency conversion, payoff planner, forecast, CSV formula neutralization, privacy gate, entitlements, and Firestore rules).\n- **Build & Type Check**: `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`) succeeded with 0 errors.\n- **Browser Check**: Verified create, partial payment, People Ledger, Payoff Planner, Forecast, and Detail Drawer flows in headless Chromium with 0 console errors and 0 warnings.\n\nWhen you\'re ready to build the Reminders & Notification Scheduler module, reply **\"Proceed to Phase 3\"**."
    message_id: "yq0Ea62SGvSPjrEPm-7NkQ4"
