passing (debt domain math, multi-currency conversion, payoff planner, forecast, CSV formula neutralization, privacy gate, entitlements, and Firestore rules).\n- **Build & Type Check**: `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`) succeeded with 0 errors.\n- **Browser Check**: Verified create, partial payment, People Ledger, Payoff Planner, Forecast, and Detail Drawer flows in headless Chromium with 0 console errors and 0 warnings.\n\nWhen you\'re ready to build the Reminders & Notification Scheduler module, reply **\"Proceed to Phase 3\"**."
