  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: **LifeOS** \342\200\224 an offline-first, AI-powered personal life operating system built as an installable React Web/PWA with an Expo-portable clean core (`src/core/*`), backed by Firebase Auth (Google Sign-In) + Cloud Firestore (`ai-studio-38d4010c-5645-4354-9129-6e97685f7872`), tri-lingual RTL support (`en`, `ar`, `ckb`), Light/Dark/AMOLED Calm Slate & Emerald theme, and a server-side Gemini AI proxy (`/api/ai/*`) with a strict Free-Tier Privacy Gate.\n- **Confirmed User Decisions**:\n  1. Live React Web/PWA here with Expo-portable domain core.\n  2. Firebase Spark free tier + Local-Only Document Vault first (zero billing risk).\n  3. English UI default with IQD/USD dual currency (plus EUR), full runtime EN/AR/Kurdish Sorani (`ckb`) RTL switching.\n  4. Opt-in AES-256-GCM E2E encryption with Recovery Key.\n  5. Calm Slate & Emerald Material You + iOS polish (Light / Dark / AMOLED).\n  6. Phased execution with user approval gate after each phase:\n     - Phase 1 (Foundation): Completed.\n     - Phase 2 (Debts Manager): Completed & verified.\n     - **Phase 3 (Smart Reminders & Notification Scheduler)**: **Currently finishing \342\200\224 all code and Firestore rules are written and deployed; ONLY verification (unit tests, build/lint, server restart, live Playwright browser & visual verification) and final summary remain.**\n     - Phase 4 (Planner + Notes), Phase 5 (Document Vault), Phase 6 (Habits + Finance + Global AI Tooling), Phase 7 (Monetization scaffolding, GDPR export, polish): Pending future user approval.\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Phase 2 (Completed & Verified)**:\n  - Finished verification, visually inspected screenshots, polished `DebtDetailDrawer.tsx` (stacked primary Log Payment CTA above 2-col Draft Reminder / Edit Debt so labels never truncate) and singular/plural counts in `DebtsAnalyticsPanels.tsx` & `DebtDetailDrawer.tsx`.\n  - Passed 20/20 unit tests, `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, and headless Playwright E2E with 0 console errors/warnings.\n\n- **Phase 3 \342\200\224 Smart Reminders & Notification Scheduler (All Code & Rules Completed, Verification Pending)**:\n  - **Skills & Plan Read**: Read `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md`, `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/references/firestore-rules-and-blueprint.md`, `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`, `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`, `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md`, and `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/38d4010c-5645-4354-9129-6e97685f7872/implementation_plan.md`.\n  - **Blueprint & Security Rules (Completed & Deployed)**:\n    - Updated `ReminderItem` in `/firebase-blueprint.json` with 8 channels, `priority`, `dueAtIso`, `rrule`, `snoozedUntilIso`, `respectQuietHours`, `status`, `isCompleted`, `completedCount`, `lastCompletedAtIso`, `linkedDebtId`.\n    - Drafted `/DRAFT_firestore.rules` with Eight-Pillar `isValidReminderItem`, `isValidIsoTimestamp`, action-split `allow update` (Complete/Advance, Snooze, Edit Metadata), terminal `archived` lock, and `status == \'completed\'` \342\206\224 `isCompleted` invariant.\n    - Audited with `npx eslint DRAFT_firestore.rules` (0 errors/warnings), promoted to `/firestore.rules`, deleted `/DRAFT_firestore.rules`, linted `firestore.rules` (clean), updated `/firestore.rules.test.ts` with Phase 3 rule assertions, and deployed via `rpc_action` (`service_name: \"fax\"`, `method_name: \"DeployRules\"` \342\200\224 succeeded).\n  - **Expo-Portable Core Domain & Tests (Completed, Not Yet Run)**:\n    - `/src/core/reminders/reminderSchemas.ts`: Zod schemas synchronized with blueprint + `REMINDER_CHANNELS` (8 dedicated notification channels: `routine`, `medicine`, `debt`, `bill`, `expiry`, `birthday`, `task`, `custom`).\n    - `/src/core/reminders/rruleEngine.ts`: RFC-5545 RRULE parser, serializer, human description, month-end-clamped occurrence expander, and `computeCompletionTransition` (advances recurring schedules or completes one-time/COUNT-exhausted reminders).\n    - `/src/core/reminders/notificationScheduler.ts`: Quiet Hours detector & shifter (overnight + daytime), `buildRollingNotificationQueue` strictly enforcing the iOS 64-pending-local-notification cap (`IOS_LOCAL_NOTIFICATION_CAP = 64`), merging open Debt due-date alerts, respecting quiet-hours bypass for urgent/medicine, and `analyzeSevenDayWorkload` deterministic overload detector.\n    - `/src/core/reminders/reminderEngine.test.ts`: Unit tests covering RRULE round-trip, Jan 31 -> Feb 28 clamping, overnight quiet-hours shift, 64-cap slicing + medicine bypass, recurring completion advancement, and 7-day overload detection.\n  - **Data, AI & Hooks Layer (Completed)**:\n    - `/src/data/repositories/interfaces.ts`: Added `RemindersRepository` interface.\n    - `/src/data/repositories/remindersRepository.ts`: Implemented `FirebaseWebRemindersRepository` (Zod validation, `handleFirestoreError`, `serverTimestamp()`, action-split payloads) and `LocalOfflineRemindersRepository` (`localStorage` key `lifeos_local_reminders_v1`).\n    - `/src/core/ai/remindersAiClient.ts`: Privacy-gated natural-language schedule parser client.\n    - `/server.ts`: Added `POST /api/ai/reminders/parse` using `@google/genai` (`gemini-4-hydrogen` \342\206\222 `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` fallback), Privacy Gate, prompt-injection delimiters, and Zod validation (returns editable preview draft only).\n    - `/src/hooks/useReminders.ts`: Real-time reminders hook integrating Quiet Hours from profile, Rolling 64-Slot Queue (with open debts), 7-day workload, CRUD/complete/snooze/restore, and real browser `Notification` API permission & test dispatch.\n  - **UI & App Wiring (Completed)**:\n    - `/src/features/reminders/ui/ReminderFormModal.tsx`: AI Quick Schedule parser (EN/AR/CKB), 8-channel picker with auto-defaults, structured RRULE recurrence builder (Once/Daily/Weekly+weekdays/Monthly/Yearly + interval/count), quiet-hours toggle, optional link to open debt.\n    - `/src/features/reminders/ui/RemindersSchedulerPanels.tsx`: `RollingQueuePanel` (64-slot inspector + browser notification controls + honest Web PWA vs. Native EAS delivery note), `ChannelsDirectoryPanel` (8 channels), `WorkloadBalancePanel` (7-day load).\n    - `/src/features/reminders/ui/RemindersView.tsx`: Main page with 4-col flat KPI strip, segmented tabs (`Agenda`, `64-Slot Queue`, `8 Channels`, `Workload Balance`), search/channel/status filters, one-tap Complete/Reopen, inline Snooze presets (`+15m`, `+1h`, `Tomorrow 09:00`), Edit, and Delete-with-Undo.\n    - `/src/core/i18n/i18n.ts`: Added full `en`, `ar`, and `ckb` `reminders.*` translations and updated `common.phaseReady` to Phase 3.\n    - `/src/App.tsx`: Wired `RemindersView` for `activeRoute === \'reminders\'`.\n    - `/src/components/AppShell.tsx`: Removed `phase: 3` badge from Reminders nav item.\n    - `/src/features/home/ui/HomeView.tsx`: Marked Reminders active, wired `useReminders()`, added live Due Today / Overdue / 64-slot queue KPI and updated Daily Briefing prompt counts.\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- `view_file` only reads paths inside the workspace root (`/`, mapped to `/app/applet`); never pass `/tmp/...` to `view_file` \342\200\224 save or copy Playwright screenshots into `.playwright-cli/` to inspect with `view_file`, then delete them cleanly before finishing.\n- `server.ts` already binds Vite middleware\'s WebSocket server to `httpServer` with `allowedHosts: true` on port 3000 (`hmrPort = null`), keeping headless Chromium console at 0 errors and 0 warnings.\n- Remember to clear `localStorage` (`lifeos_local_reminders_v1`) at the end of Playwright E2E tests so zero synthetic test data remains in the user\'s offline workspace.\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Phase 2 Playwright selector mismatch**: Targeted `getByPlaceholder(\'e.g. Karwan Ali\')` when actual placeholder was `\'Omar Ali / \330\271\331\205\330\261 \330\271\331\204\331\212\'`. Fixed by inspecting `DebtFormModal.tsx` and targeting exact placeholders/selectors.\n- **Phase 2 `view_file` on `/tmp/*.png`**: Failed because `/tmp` is outside workspace root `/`. Fixed by copying screenshots to `.playwright-cli/` before calling `view_file`, then cleaning up with `rm -f`.\n- **Phase 2 visual audit caught truncation**: In `DebtDetailDrawer.tsx`, 3 equal-width buttons caused `\"Draft Remind...\"` truncation, and Forecast showed `\"1 items\"`. Fixed both via surgical edits.\n- **Phase 3**: No errors encountered yet; tests, build, and live browser checks have not been run since completing Phase 3 edits.\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- Dev server is running the pre-Phase-3 version of `server.ts` (before `/api/ai/reminders/parse` was added) \342\200\224 **must run `restart_dev_server` after `compile_applet`** so the new Express route is live.\n- Firestore rules for Phase 3 are **already deployed** (`fax.DeployRules` succeeded).\n- No background tasks or temporary files are active.\n\n### 6. Next Steps (Exact Sequence to Finish Phase 3)\n1. **Run all unit tests** via `run_command`:\n   ```bash\n   npx tsx --test src/core/reminders/reminderEngine.test.ts src/core/debts/debtEngine.test.ts firestore.rules.test.ts src/core/currency/currency.test.ts src/core/ai/privacyGate.test.ts src/core/entitlements/entitlements.test.ts\n   ```\n   Verify all tests pass (should be ~26 tests passing).\n2. **Compile & type-check**: Run `compile_applet` (and fix any TS/Vite issues if found).\n3. **Restart dev server**: Call `restart_dev_server` so `/api/ai/reminders/parse` in `server.ts` is live.\n4. **Live Playwright E2E + Visual Inspection**:\n   - Open `http://localhost:3000`, navigate to **Reminders**, create:\n     1. A **Medicine** daily reminder at `23:00` (verify auto-defaults: urgent + bypasses quiet hours, `FREQ=DAILY`).\n     2. A **Routine** weekly reminder at `22:30` with `Su/We` selected (verify `Respect Quiet Hours` shifts it to `07:00` in the 64-Slot Queue!).\n     3. A one-time **Bill** reminder due earlier today (overdue) and test **Snooze (`+1h`)** and **Complete** (verify recurring advances to next date, one-time moves to Completed).\n   - Capture screenshots into `.playwright-cli/` for:\n     - Populated Reminders Agenda\n     - Rolling 64-Slot Queue Inspector (showing quiet-hour shift + medicine bypass)\n     - 8 Channels Directory & 7-Day Workload Balance\n     - ReminderFormModal (with RRULE builder open)\n   - Clear `localStorage.removeItem(\'lifeos_local_reminders_v1\')` inside the Playwright script before closing.\n   - Verify `playwright-cli console` reports **0 errors and 0 warnings**, then `playwright-cli close`.\n   - Visually inspect screenshots with `view_file` (check contrast, zero truncation, single-line controls, clean hairline alignment), fix any visual flaws found, and delete `.playwright-cli/*.png`.\n5. **Final Verification Gate**: Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together in the same turn (mandatory before finishing).\n6. **Respond to User**: Present a concise, scannable summary of Phase 3 (Smart Reminders & Notification Scheduler), politely encourage the user to review the deployed Firestore rules as noted in the Firebase skill, and pause for approval (`\"Proceed to Phase 4\"` for Planner & Rich Markdown Notes).\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **No Mock Data**: Keep the app free of hardcoded/seeded user records; clean up any localStorage items created during Playwright E2E verification.\n- **No Unwired Controls / Zero-Pill Metadata**: Keep all metadata unboxed with `\302\267` separators, tabular numerals (`font-numeric`), single-elevation hairline surfaces, and logical RTL classes (`ps-*`, `pe-*`, `text-start`, `border-s`).\n- **Co-execute Final Build + Lint**: Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together on the final check.\n- **Phased Gate**: Do NOT start Phase 4 automatically; pause after Phase 3 and ask the user to reply `\"Proceed to Phase 4\"`.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 248
    included_step_index_end: 357
