    thinking: "**Analyzing Verification Scripts**\n\nI\'m impressed by the precision of the labels and controls. My next move is to execute a single headless Playwright verification script. I\'ll use `playwright-cli` for this, and will default to Playwright via `playwright-cli` if it\'s available. I\'ll verify availability before proceeding.\n\n\n"
