  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Spotting Improvement Opportunities**\n\nI\'ve just been reviewing some screenshots and immediately identified two areas for improvement! In the `HomeView`\'s KPI section, the \"Reminders\" cell has a line break in an awkward spot, suggesting a quick visual fix. Also, a text formatting inconsistency in the \"Projects\" section of the same `HomeView` immediately stood out. Both are minor tweaks but could really improve the UI\342\200\231s aesthetic appeal.\n\n\n**Refining KPI Display**\n\nI\'m now thinking about how to keep KPI headlines crisp, and I\'m leaning towards `\"1 due\"` (or `\"1 due today\"`) paired with a single-line subtext like `\"0 overdue \302\267 Queue 37/64\"`. Furthermore, I identified an issue with the Daily Briefing fallback text on `HomeView` when reminders exist. It seems hardcoded to an empty state, even with pending reminders or open debts. I\'ll need to update it to show the correct counts, something like `\"2 active reminders (1 due today) \302\267 0 open debts \342\200\224 click Generate Briefing Preview to summarize.\"`\n\n\n\n"
    message_id: "9bAEa_GgOJWX9MoP6OXhwAc"
