              text: "    const prompt = `Provide a calm 2-sentence daily briefing for a LifeOS workspace. Primary currency: ${profile.primaryCurrency}, Secondary: ${profile.secondaryCurrency}. Open debts: ${debtMetrics.totalOpenCount}, Overdue debts: ${debtMetrics.totalOverdueCount}, Net debt position: ${netFmt}, reminders due today: ${remSummary.dueTodayCount}, overdue reminders: ${remSummary.overdueCount}, scheduled rolling queue slots: ${rollingQueue.slots.length}/64, expiring vault docs: 0. Suggest one practical next step.`;"
