  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Advancing Project Phases**\n\nI\'m now diving into Phase 4, focusing on the Planner and Rich Markdown Notes. I\'m thinking about how to integrate Tasks and a Unified Calendar with Markdown Notes, including nested folders, version history, and optional AES-256-GCM encryption for security. I\'m exploring the \'firebase\' skill to see if it\'s relevant for this phase.\n\n\n**Refining Technical Specifications**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in the technical specifications. The `firebase-integration-rpc` skill is crucial, with updates to `firebase-blueprint.json`, security rules for tasks and notes, and Firebase Web repositories underway. Concurrently, `frontend-design` is shaping the Planner and Rich Markdown Notes interfaces. I\'m building AI endpoints with `gemini-api`, focusing on privacy for sensitive operations.\n\n\n"
