  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: **LifeOS** \342\200\224 an offline-first, AI-powered personal life operating system built as a React Web/PWA with an Expo-portable clean core (`src/core/*`), backed by Firebase Auth (Google Sign-In) + Cloud Firestore (`ai-studio-38d4010c-5645-4354-9129-6e97685f7872`), tri-lingual RTL (`en`, `ar`, `ckb`), Calm Slate & Emerald theme (Light / Dark / AMOLED), and server-side Gemini AI proxy (`/api/ai/*`) with a strict Free-Tier Privacy Gate.\n- **Confirmed User Decisions**:\n  1. Live React Web/PWA here with Expo-portable domain core.\n  2. Firebase Spark free tier + Local-Only Document Vault first (zero billing risk).\n  3. English UI default with IQD/USD dual currency (plus EUR) and runtime EN/AR/Kurdish Sorani (`ckb`) RTL switching.\n  4. Opt-in AES-256-GCM E2E encryption with Recovery Key.\n  5. Calm Slate & Emerald Material You + iOS polish (Light / Dark / AMOLED).\n  6. Phased execution with approval gate after each phase:\n     - Phases 1\342\200\2233 (Foundation, Debts Manager, Smart Reminders): **Completed, verified, and approved.**\n     - **Phase 4 (Planner + Rich Markdown Notes)**: **Currently in progress \342\200\224 Firestore blueprint & hardened rules are deployed, all Phase 4 core engines, unit tests, AI server routes/clients, repositories, hooks, and UI components are written; ONLY final app wiring (`App.tsx`, `AppShell.tsx`, `HomeView.tsx`, `i18n.ts`) and verification (unit tests, build, server restart, Playwright E2E + visual check, final co-executed build+lint) remain.**\n     - Phases 5\342\200\2237 (Vault, Habits+Finance+Global AI Tools, Monetization/GDPR/Polish): Pending future user approval.\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Phase 3 (Completed & Verified)**:\n  - Passed 26/26 unit tests, `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, and headless Playwright E2E with 0 console errors/warnings.\n  - Polished `HomeView.tsx` 4th KPI cell (`whitespace-nowrap`, single-line `\"X due today\"`) and pre-briefing status counts.\n  - User replied `\"continue\"` to begin Phase 4.\n\n- **Phase 4 \342\200\224 Planner (Tasks & Unified Calendar) + Rich Markdown Notes (Code & Rules Built; Wiring & Verification Pending)**:\n  - **Skills & References Read**:\n    - `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md`\n    - `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/references/firestore-rules-and-blueprint.md`\n    - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`\n    - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`\n    - `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md`\n    - `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/38d4010c-5645-4354-9129-6e97685f7872/implementation_plan.md`\n  - **Blueprint & Hardened Firestore Rules (Completed, Linted & Deployed)**:\n    - Updated `/firebase-blueprint.json`: Expanded `TaskItem` (`notes`, `sortKey` pattern `^[0-9A-Za-z]+$`, `dueDate`, bounded `subtasks`, bounded `tags`, `completedAtIso`), added `NoteFolder` (`name`, `parentId`, `sortKey`, `isLockedFolder`), expanded `NoteItem` (`folderId`, `tags`, `wordCount`), added `NoteVersion` (`noteId`, `title`, `content`, `isEncrypted`, `versionNumber`, `createdAt`), and added paths `/users/{userId}/noteFolders/{folderId}` and `/users/{userId}/notes/{noteId}/versions/{versionId}`.\n    - Drafted `/DRAFT_firestore.rules`, audited with `npx eslint DRAFT_firestore.rules` (0 errors/warnings), promoted to `/firestore.rules`, deleted `/DRAFT_firestore.rules`, re-linted `firestore.rules` (0 errors/warnings), updated `/firestore.rules.test.ts` with Phase 4 invariant & collection checks, and deployed live via `rpc_action` (`service_name: \"fax\"`, `method_name: \"DeployRules\"` \342\200\224 succeeded).\n  - **Expo-Portable Core Domain & Tests (Completed, Not Yet Executed)**:\n    - `/src/core/planner/fractionalIndex.ts`: Pure base-62 (`0-9A-Za-z`) lexicographic midpoint generator (`generateSortKeyBetween`, `compareSortKeys`, `sortBySortKey`) for O(1) single-write task/folder reordering.\n    - `/src/core/planner/plannerSchemas.ts`: Zod schemas for `TaskItem`, `SubtaskItem`, `CreateTaskInput`, `DEFAULT_TASK_LISTS` (`inbox`, `personal`, `work`, `finance`, `health`), and priority metadata (`P1`\342\200\223`P4`).\n    - `/src/core/planner/unifiedCalendar.ts`: Pure 42-day monthly calendar grid builder merging Tasks, Reminders, and Open Debts (`buildUnifiedMonthlyCalendar`, `formatLocalYmd`).\n    - `/src/core/notes/noteSchemas.ts`: Zod schemas for `NoteFolder`, `NoteItem`, `NoteVersion`, `CreateNoteInput`, `CreateFolderInput`, `countMarkdownWords`, and cycle-safe `buildFolderTree` / `flattenFolderTree`.\n    - `/src/core/notes/safeMarkdown.ts`: Zero-`dangerouslySetInnerHTML` Markdown AST parser (`parseMarkdownBlocks`, `parseInlineMarkdown`, `isSafeHttpUrl`, `toggleMarkdownChecklistLine`) neutralizing `javascript:`/`data:` URLs.\n    - `/src/core/planner/plannerEngine.test.ts`: Unit tests for 50 sequential midpoint fractional-index insertions, prepending, and unified monthly calendar merging.\n    - `/src/core/notes/notesEngine.test.ts`: Unit tests for nested folder trees + self-parent cycle guard, safe Markdown AST + `javascript:` neutralization + checklist toggle, and AES-256-GCM locked note round-trip + Privacy Gate blocking locked notes.\n  - **AI Server Routes & Privacy-Gated Clients (Completed)**:\n    - `/server.ts`: Added `POST /api/ai/planner/breakdown` (goal-to-subtasks preview draft) and `POST /api/ai/notes/assist` (summarize / action_items / polish \342\200\224 hard-blocked by Privacy Gate when `isLockedOrEncrypted` is true), both using `@google/genai` (`gemini-4-hydrogen` / `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`), `<untrusted_user_input>` delimiters, and Zod validation.\n    - `/src/core/ai/plannerAiClient.ts` and `/src/core/ai/notesAiClient.ts`.\n  - **Repositories & Hooks (Completed)**:\n    - `/src/data/repositories/interfaces.ts`: Added `PlannerRepository` and `NotesRepository`.\n    - `/src/data/repositories/plannerRepository.ts`: `FirebaseWebPlannerRepository` + `LocalOfflinePlannerRepository` (`lifeos_local_tasks_v1`).\n    - `/src/data/repositories/notesRepository.ts`: `FirebaseWebNotesRepository` + `LocalOfflineNotesRepository` (`lifeos_local_note_folders_v1`, `lifeos_local_notes_v1`, `lifeos_local_note_versions_v1`).\n    - `/src/hooks/usePlanner.ts`: Real-time tasks, single-write fractional-index reorder (`reorderTaskBetween`), status/subtasks toggles, CRUD with undo, live KPIs.\n    - `/src/hooks/useNotes.ts`: Real-time folders & notes, immutable version snapshots & restore, and session-scoped in-memory AES-256-GCM `CryptoKey` vault unlock/lock/encrypt/decrypt (wipes automatically when app lock activates).\n  - **UI Components (Completed)**:\n    - `/src/features/planner/ui/TaskFormModal.tsx`: Create/Edit task with AI Goal Breakdown preview & dynamic subtask builder (capped at 20).\n    - `/src/features/planner/ui/UnifiedCalendarPanel.tsx`: Monthly calendar grid merging Tasks, Reminders, and Open Debts with day inspector and \"+ Add Task\".\n    - `/src/features/planner/ui/PlannerView.tsx`: 4-col flat KPI strip, `Tasks Board` / `Unified Calendar` segmented tabs, drag-and-drop + Move Up/Down fractional-index reordering, expandable subtasks, Delete-with-Undo.\n    - `/src/features/notes/ui/SafeMarkdownPreview.tsx`: Pure React AST renderer (no `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`) with interactive checkboxes.\n    - `/src/features/notes/ui/NoteSecurityModal.tsx`: Opt-in AES-256-GCM passphrase setup + Recovery Key display and session unlock dialog.\n    - `/src/features/notes/ui/NotesView.tsx`: 3-pane studio (Nested Folders, Notes List, Rich Markdown Editor / Split / Preview with formatting toolbar, Version History Drawer, E2E Lock/Unlock toggle, and Privacy-Gated Note AI Assist with one-click \"+ Send to Planner\").\n  - **Read But Not Yet Edited (Ready for Immediate Wiring)**:\n    - `/src/App.tsx` (lines 1\342\200\22346 read)\n    - `/src/components/AppShell.tsx` (lines 1\342\200\223393 read)\n    - `/src/core/i18n/i18n.ts` (lines 1\342\200\223771 read)\n    - `/src/features/home/ui/HomeView.tsx` (lines 1\342\200\223376 read earlier)\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- Every `view_file` call must target workspace-relative paths starting with `/` (e.g. `.playwright-cli/*.png` for visual inspection, then `rm -rf .playwright-cli` before finishing).\n- In Phase 3, `playwright-cli` worked smoothly (`open`, `run-code`, `console`, `close`); remember to clean up `localStorage` keys (`lifeos_local_tasks_v1`, `lifeos_local_notes_v1`, `lifeos_local_note_folders_v1`, `lifeos_local_note_versions_v1`, and `lifeos_profile_v1` if E2E profile test modifies it) at the end of Playwright tests so zero synthetic test data remains.\n- Dev server is still running the pre-Phase-4 `server.ts` \342\200\224 MUST call `restart_dev_server` after `compile_applet` so `/api/ai/planner/breakdown` and `/api/ai/notes/assist` are live.\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Phase 3 E2E selector fix**: Initially looked for `\'New Reminder\'` instead of actual i18n label `\'Add Reminder\'`; resolved by grepping `i18n.ts` and updating selector.\n- **Phase 3 visual audit polish**: Fixed 2-line wrapping on `HomeView.tsx` 4th KPI cell (`\"1 due \302\267 0 overdue\"` -> `\"1 due today\"` with `whitespace-nowrap`) and updated pre-briefing fallback text to reflect real active counts.\n- **Phase 4**: Zero errors so far; unit tests, build, and Playwright verification have not been executed yet.\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- Phase 4 Firestore rules are **already deployed** (`fax.DeployRules` succeeded).\n- All Phase 4 domain, repository, hook, AI, and UI files are created and ready; only the 4 app wiring files (`App.tsx`, `AppShell.tsx`, `HomeView.tsx`, `i18n.ts`) need edits before testing.\n- No background tasks or temporary files are active.\n\n### 6. Next Steps (Exact Priority Order to Finish Phase 4)\n1. **Wire Phase 4 into the App (4 parallel edits)**:\n   - `/src/core/i18n/i18n.ts`:\n     - Update `common.phaseReady` across `en`, `ar`, `ckb` to Phase 4 (`\'Phase 4 \302\267 Debts, Reminders, Planner & Notes Active\'` + Arabic/Kurdish equivalents).\n     - Add complete `planner.*` and `notes.*` translation keys for `en`, `ar`, and `ckb` matching every key used in `PlannerView.tsx`, `TaskFormModal.tsx`, and `NotesView.tsx`:\n       - `planner`: `title`, `subtitle`, `addTask`, `editTask`, `saveTask`, `saveChanges`, `aiGoalBreakdown`, `aiGoalPlaceholder`, `aiBreakdownBtn`, `aiBreakdownNotice`, `kpiActive`, `kpiDueToday`, `kpiCompleted`, `kpiCalendarItems`, `tabTasks`, `tabCalendar`, `searchPlaceholder`, `allLists`, `listInbox`, `listPersonal`, `listWork`, `listFinance`, `listHealth`, `statusTodo`, `statusInProgress`, `statusDone`, `taskTitleLabel`, `listLabel`, `priorityLabel`, `dueDateLabel`, `subtasksLabel`, `addSubtaskPlaceholder`, `emptyTitle`, `emptyDesc`.\n       - `notes`: `title`, `subtitle`, `newNote`, `allNotes`, `pinnedNotes`, `lockedNotes`, `foldersTitle`, `searchPlaceholder`, `emptyTitle`, `emptyDesc`.\n   - `/src/App.tsx`: Import `PlannerView` and `NotesView` and render them for `activeRoute === \'planner\'` and `activeRoute === \'notes\'`.\n   - `/src/components/AppShell.tsx`: Remove `phase: 4` from `planner` and `notes` items in `ALL_NAV_ITEMS`.\n   - `/src/features/home/ui/HomeView.tsx`: Mark `planner` and `notes` `active: true` (remove `phase: 4`) in `MODULE_SPECS`, wire `usePlanner()` and `useNotes()`, include active task count in the Daily Briefing prompt & pre-briefing status text.\n2. **Run ALL Unit Tests** via `run_command`:\n   ```bash\n   npx tsx --test src/core/planner/plannerEngine.test.ts src/core/notes/notesEngine.test.ts src/core/reminders/reminderEngine.test.ts src/core/debts/debtEngine.test.ts firestore.rules.test.ts src/core/currency/currency.test.ts src/core/ai/privacyGate.test.ts src/core/entitlements/entitlements.test.ts\n   ```\n   Verify all tests pass (should be 32/32 tests passing).\n3. **Compile & Restart Dev Server**:\n   - Run `compile_applet` (fix any TS/Vite issues if found).\n   - Call `restart_dev_server` so `/api/ai/planner/breakdown` and `/api/ai/notes/assist` are live.\n4. **Live Playwright E2E + Visual Inspection**:\n   - Open `http://localhost:3000` at `1280x860`:\n     - **Planner**: Create 2 tasks (one with 2 subtasks + due today + P1 Urgent, one P2 High); expand subtasks & check 1 off; click **Move task up** to verify single-write fractional-index `sortKey` reorder; screenshot `p4_planner_tasks.png`; switch to **Unified Calendar** tab, verify task appears on today\'s cell, screenshot `p4_planner_calendar.png`.\n     - **Notes**: Create a nested folder (`Projects` -> `LifeOS Q4`), create a Markdown note with `# Plan`, `**bold**`, and `- [ ] Verify E2E`, save it, edit & save again to verify **Version History** records v1 snapshot, open Version History drawer and screenshot `p4_notes_versions.png`; close drawer, click **Lock E2E**, configure an 8+ char passphrase in `NoteSecurityModal`, verify Recovery Key displays, continue to encrypt the note, click **Lock Session**, verify sealed AES-256-GCM lock screen renders and Note AI buttons are disabled (`Blocked on E2E locked notes`), screenshot `p4_notes_locked.png`; also screenshot regular split Markdown editor/preview (`p4_notes_editor.png`).\n     - **Clean up `localStorage`** (`lifeos_local_tasks_v1`, `lifeos_local_notes_v1`, `lifeos_local_note_folders_v1`, `lifeos_local_note_versions_v1`, `lifeos_profile_v1`) before closing browser so zero test records remain.\n     - Run `playwright-cli console` (must report 0 errors, 0 warnings) and `playwright-cli close`.\n     - Visually inspect all screenshots with `view_file` (or directly from tool output if returned), polish any visual issues found, and delete `.playwright-cli` (`rm -rf .playwright-cli`).\n5. **Final Verification Gate**: Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together in the same turn.\n6. **Respond to User**: Present a concise, scannable summary of Phase 4 (Planner + Rich Markdown Notes), remind the user to review the updated `firestore.rules`, and pause for approval (`\"Proceed to Phase 5\"` for Document Vault).\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Zero Mock Data / Zero Synthetic Leftovers**: Always clear localStorage test records created during E2E runs.\n- **Zero `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`**: Notes Markdown preview uses typed AST React rendering only; links strictly filtered to `http://`/`https://`.\n- **Anti-Slop & Zero-Pill Discipline**: Keep unboxed metadata (`\302\267` separators), tabular numerals (`font-numeric`), hairline single-elevation surfaces, logical RTL classes (`ps-*`, `pe-*`, `text-start`, `border-s`), and no thick left accent borders.\n- **Co-execute Final Build + Lint**: Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in parallel on the final check.\n- **Phased Gate**: Do NOT start Phase 5 automatically; pause after Phase 4 for user approval.\n</summary>"
