    thinking: "**Executing the E2E script**\n\nI\'ve made sure all aria-labels and placeholders are now perfectly clear. My focus is on running the Phase 4 E2E test suite, complete with screenshots. I will start Playwright, open the localhost instance, execute the script, inspect the console, and then close everything gracefully. Let\'s get this test running!\n\n\n"
