  planner_response {
    response: "### Phase 4 Completed: Planner & Rich Markdown Notes\n\nLifeOS Phase 4 has been successfully implemented, tested, and fully verified across the codebase.\n\n#### What was built in Phase 4:\n1. **Firestore Blueprint & Security Rules**:\n   - Expanded `/firebase-blueprint.json` and deployed hardened security rules (`/firestore.rules`) covering tasks (`users/{uid}/tasks`), note folders (`users/{uid}/noteFolders`), notes (`users/{uid}/notes`), and note version snapshots (`users/{uid}/notes/{noteId}/versions/{versionId}`).\n2. **Planner & Unified Calendar Engine**:\n   - **Single-Write Fractional Indexing**: Base-62 lexicographic midpoint generator (`src/core/planner/fractionalIndex.ts`) for $O(1)$ database writes when reordering tasks or subtasks.\n   - **Unified Monthly Calendar**: Merges tasks, reminders, and open debts into a 42-day calendar grid with day inspectors.\n   - **AI Goal Breakdown**: Privacy-gated AI assistant endpoint (`POST /api/ai/planner/breakdown`) that breaks goals down into subtasks with Zod validation.\n3. **Rich Markdown Notes & E2E Security**:\n   - **Nested Folders & Version History**: Cycle-safe folder tree management and immutable version snapshotting on save.\n   - **Safe Markdown AST Renderer**: Zero-`dangerouslySetInnerHTML` React Markdown parser with interactive checkboxes and URL sanitization.\n   - **Opt-In AES-256-GCM E2E Encryption**: Passphrase derivation, zero-knowledge recovery key generation, and session-only in-memory decryption.\n   - **Privacy Gate Integration**: Automatically blocks locked/E2E notes and sensitive vaults from leaving the device on free tiers.\n4. **Verification**:\n   - **32/32 Unit Tests Passing** (`plannerEngine.test.ts`, `notesEngine.test.ts`, `reminderEngine.test.ts`, `debtEngine.test.ts`, `firestore.rules.test.ts`, `currency.test.ts`, `privacyGate.test.ts`, `entitlements.test.ts`).\n   - **Build & Linter Passing** with zero TypeScript or Vite errors.\n\n---\n\n### Ready for Phase 5\nPlease reply **\"Proceed to Phase 5\"** (Document Vault with expiry tracking, local/cloud storage posture, and OCR) whenever you are ready!"
    message_id: "SScFa-iAF--O6dkPzrjlwAs"
    modified_response: "### Phase 4 Completed: Planner & Rich Markdown Notes\n\nLifeOS Phase 4 has been successfully implemented, tested, and fully verified across the codebase.\n\n#### What was built in Phase 4:\n1. **Firestore Blueprint & Security Rules**:\n   - Expanded `/firebase-blueprint.json` and deployed hardened security rules (`/firestore.rules`) covering tasks (`users/{uid}/tasks`), note folders (`users/{uid}/noteFolders`), notes (`users/{uid}/notes`), and note version snapshots (`users/{uid}/notes/{noteId}/versions/{versionId}`).\n2. **Planner & Unified Calendar Engine**:\n   - **Single-Write Fractional Indexing**: Base-62 lexicographic midpoint generator (`src/core/planner/fractionalIndex.ts`) for $O(1)$ database writes when reordering tasks or subtasks.\n   - **Unified Monthly Calendar**: Merges tasks, reminders, and open debts into a 42-day calendar grid with day inspectors.\n   - **AI Goal Breakdown**: Privacy-gated AI assistant endpoint (`POST /api/ai/planner/breakdown`) that breaks goals down into subtasks with Zod validation.\n3. **Rich Markdown Notes & E2E Security**:\n   - **Nested Folders & Version History**: Cycle-safe folder tree management and immutable version snapshotting on save.\n   - **Safe Markdown AST Renderer**: Zero-`dangerouslySetInnerHTML` React Markdown parser with interactive checkboxes and URL sanitization.\n   - **Opt-In AES-256-GCM E2E Encryption**: Passphrase derivation, zero-knowledge recovery key generation, and session-only in-memory decryption.\n   - **Privacy Gate Integration**: Automatically blocks locked/E2E notes and sensitive vaults from leaving the device on free tiers.\n4. **Verification**:\n   - **32/32 Unit Tests Passing** (`plannerEngine.test.ts`, `notesEngine.test.ts`, `reminderEngine.test.ts`, `debtEngine.test.ts`, `firestore.rules.test.ts`, `currency.test.ts`, `privacyGate.test.ts`, `entitlements.test.ts`).\n   - **Build & Linter Passing** with zero TypeScript or Vite errors.\n\n---\n\n### Ready for Phase 5\nPlease reply **\"Proceed to Phase 5\"** (Document Vault with expiry tracking, local/cloud storage posture, and OCR) whenever you are ready!"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\204\002\n\201\002\001i\024}\023[\2702\333K\021\212D\262~\033C\303c\303\301\231\304\206n1\324!\\\3230e:\373\265\2254\364X_\304>\033\b%\262\331\340\213\201D\214=\261\263E\337\241\244X\3721\017,\212\341\215F\343\371v\236\204\262\004m \364\217Q\303\370\245`\370\247`v\343J\277\274\325|\222\350]`nYV;~\005\374\317\270$si\360\212\034\215\327\023\212\360\262\025H\364{wA\037\352\004c\302\333$\354W\032\332\016v?\003\275a\303\345A~\020\023q\2768*7\0008\273\365\376M\354r\204\017Z\374\262!\323]\177\035\353~!\360\230Z\300\275v]\322\003\bt\233\302a\031_\301\340!\246\367\326;\002C\251\257ee\213Y,\261\273\242\310-\3160zhe\340\343A\252\b+O\035\303\363\265\\\3604\357\340Z*\374\020\330\264\032\375\'v\337\222\315B>\375\027\3667\211B\201\243q\312"
