  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Planning Phase 5**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in designing Phase 5: the Document Vault. I\'m carefully reviewing all architectural requirements, ensuring every detail from the initial user spec and approved plan is considered. My focus is on the zero-billing local vault, expiry alerts, the scan/enhance/PDF pipeline, opt-in AES-256-GCM encryption, and privacy-gated OCR and AI.\n\n\n**Assessing Storage Options**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the storage aspects, specifically the \'local-only\' option via IndexedDB and the Firebase Spark Free Tier to minimize billing risk. The metadata will sync to Cloud Firestore, but the raw binary files are staying local. I\'m building with clear messaging for the user about cloud storage\'s requirements. This includes options for opting-in to cloud storage. The architecture is ready for future integration.\n\n\n**Defining Firestore Structures**\n\nI\'m now deep in defining the Firestore entities and rules. I\'ve designed the `VaultFolder` and `VaultDocumentMeta` structures, laying out their fields, including validation rules and data types. I\'m focusing on attributes like `folderId`, `docType`, `storageMode`, and `isEncrypted`, ensuring data integrity and security, especially with the `localFileKey` and sensitive metadata. Also working on the best approach for reminder IDs.\n\n\n**Refining Core Schemas**\n\nI\'m now iterating on core data schemas, specifically focusing on refining the Zod schemas for `VaultFolder`, `VaultDocumentMeta`, and related input types like `CreateVaultFolderInput` and `CreateVaultDocumentInput`. This involves incorporating fields like `optional valid ID`, `version`, `createdAt`, and `updatedAt`, and ensuring that the cycle-safe folder tree builder is properly constructed. I\'m also ensuring the schemas align well with the Firestore structures.\n\n\n**Analyzing Expiry Logic**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the details of expiry calculations. I\'ve built the expiry engine, which analyzes documents and classifies them based on their expiry status. I\'m focusing on calculating exact days remaining and generating one-click Smart Reminder payloads that seamlessly integrate with Phase 3\'s Reminders. I\'m excited about this part. I\'ve also focused on the zero-dependency PDF generator, including the jpeg-to-pdf encoder.\n\n\n**Finalizing Security Protocols**\n\nI\'m now implementing robust security protocols. I\'m focusing on encryption/decryption of binary data using AES-256-GCM to enhance data privacy, ensuring files are encrypted before storage. This involves detailed tests for the expiry evaluator, PDF generator, and AES encryption/decryption round trips. I\'m also ensuring the cycle protection and privacy gate are thoroughly tested to block sensitive data.\n\n\n**Implementing Storage Details**\n\nI\'ve been working on the storage layer\'s implementation. My focus is on IndexedDB for local storage and Firebase for metadata, with full encryption for security. The `VaultBinaryStorageAdapter` interface is designed for flexible storage, while the real-time folders and document metadata hook is being polished. A key feature will be the one-click reminder integration with the Reminders module.\n\n\n**Blocking Sensitive Data**\n\nI\'m now implementing the privacy gate. It strictly blocks sending scanned images of documents like passports or national IDs to free-tier cloud services. In the document inspector, I\'m integrating on-device OCR/extracted text capabilities. A panel will indicate the privacy gate\'s status, explaining why free-tier cloud AI is blocked. Users will be able to test the gate and see a checklist to enable cloud AI if they upgrade. Non-sensitive text snippets can be summarized via the API if they pass the privacy gate.\n\n\n**Designing Vault UI**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in the UI design. I\'m focusing on the `DocumentScannerModal` for seamless camera capture, file uploads, multi-page scanning, real-time enhancements, and PDF generation. I\'m also developing the `VaultView` with a KPI strip and a responsive studio layout to improve the user experience, while integrating clear indicators for encryption and storage posture.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "pWUFa76KIIKekdUPyoTj-Ac"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_12061700835286765"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add VaultFolder entity and expand VaultDocumentMeta schema in firebase-blueprint.json for Phase 5 Document Vault\", \"Instruction\":\"Add VaultFolder entity, expand VaultDocumentMeta properties for Phase 5, and register /users/{userId}/vaultFolders/{folderId} in firestore paths.\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":278, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    \\\"VaultFolder\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"VaultFolder\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Nested folder for organizing Document Vault items, with optional E2E default lock.\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"name\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 80 },\\n        \\\"parentId\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"sortKey\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 64, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[0-9A-Za-z]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"isLockedFolder\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"boolean\\\" },\\n        \\\"version\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"name\\\", \\\"sortKey\\\", \\\"isLockedFolder\\\", \\\"version\\\", \\\"createdAt\\\", \\\"updatedAt\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"VaultDocumentMeta\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"VaultDocumentMeta\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Document Vault metadata with expiry tracking and local/cloud posture (never stores raw binaries in Firestore).\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"folderId\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"title\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 200 },\\n        \\\"docType\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"passport\\\", \\\"id\\\", \\\"license\\\", \\\"insurance\\\", \\\"warranty\\\", \\\"invoice\\\", \\\"contract\\\", \\\"receipt\\\", \\\"medical\\\", \\\"other\\\"] },\\n        \\\"storageMode\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"local_only\\\", \\\"cloud_private\\\"] },\\n        \\\"mimeType\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 100 },\\n        \\\"sizeBytes\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"pageCount\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"expiryDate\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 10, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^\\\\\\\\d{4}-\\\\\\\\d{2}-\\\\\\\\d{2}$\\\" },\\n        \\\"issuer\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 120 },\\n        \\\"documentNumberLast4\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 16 },\\n        \\\"tags\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Bounded up to 10 short string tags.\\\" },\\n        \\\"notes\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 2000 },\\n        \\\"ocrText\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 20000 },\\n        \\\"isEncrypted\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"boolean\\\" },\\n        \\\"isLocked\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"boolean\\\" },\\n        \\\"localFileKey\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"linked