  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Security Posture**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the linting process is now clean, with no ESLint errors or warnings. Moving forward, I\'m performing a rapid Red Team Audit check on the newly implemented Phase 5 rules. Specifically, I\'m examining the `vaultFolders/{folderId}` endpoint, verifying that access controls are correctly enforced for single-document operations, and on creation and updates, ensuring that ownership, validity, and self-referential conditions are all correctly assessed.\n\n\n**Promoting Firestore Rules**\n\nI\'ve successfully preserved all previous collections: Users, Entitlements, AiUsage, etc. I\'m now focusing on promoting `DRAFT_firestore.rules` to `firestore.rules`. My plan is to move the file after deletion or overwriting the target, which will ensure a clean promotion. I\'m ready for the next phase.\n\n\n"
