    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: **LifeOS** \342\200\224 an offline-first, AI-powered personal life operating system built as a React Web/PWA with an Expo-portable clean core (`src/core/*`), backed by Firebase Auth (Google Sign-In) + Cloud Firestore (`ai-studio-38d4010c-5645-4354-9129-6e97685f7872`), tri-lingual RTL (`en`, `ar`, `ckb`), Calm Slate & Emerald theme (Light / Dark / AMOLED), and server-side Gemini AI proxy (`/api/ai/*`) with a strict Free-Tier Privacy Gate.\n- **Confirmed User Decisions**:\n  1. Live React Web/PWA here with Expo-portable domain core.\n  2. Firebase Spark free tier + Local-Only Document Vault first (zero Blaze billing risk).\n  3. English UI default with IQD/USD dual currency (plus EUR) and runtime EN/AR/Kurdish Sorani (`ckb`) RTL switching.\n  4. Opt-in AES-256-GCM E2E encryption with Recovery Key.\n  5. Calm Slate & Emerald Material You + iOS polish (Light / Dark / AMOLED).\n  6. Phased execution with approval gate after each phase:\n     - Phases 1\342\200\2234 (Foundation, Debts Manager, Smart Reminders, Planner + Rich Markdown Notes): **Completed, verified, and approved.**\n     - **Phase 5 (Document Vault)**: **All code, Firestore blueprint, hardened rules (deployed live), unit tests, repositories, hooks, UI components, and app wiring (`App.tsx`, `AppShell.tsx`, `HomeView.tsx`, `i18n.ts`) are WRITTEN; ONLY verification remains (unit tests, compile, lint, Playwright E2E + visual audit, cleanup, and final co-executed compile+lint).**\n     - Phases 6\342\200\2237 (Habits + Finance + Global AI Tool-Calling Search; Monetization/GDPR/Polish): Pending future user approval after Phase 5 completes.\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Phase 4 (Completed & Verified)**:\n  - Fixed `notesRepository.ts` / `plannerRepository.ts` import path (`../firebase/firebaseClient`), updated `notesEngine.test.ts` Privacy Gate code (`BLOCKED_E2E_OR_LOCKED`), fixed `useNotes.ts` (`isAppLocked` instead of `isLocked`), passed **32/32 unit tests**, `compile_applet`, and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit` 0 errors). User replied `\"continue\"` to start Phase 5.\n\n- **Phase 5 \342\200\224 Document Vault (All Implementation Completed; Verification Pending)**:\n  - **Skills & References Read**:\n    - `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md`\n    - `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/references/firestore-rules-and-blueprint.md`\n    - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`\n    - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`\n    - `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/38d4010c-5645-4354-9129-6e97685f7872/implementation_plan.md`\n  - **Blueprint & Hardened Firestore Rules (Completed, Linted & Deployed Live)**:\n    - Updated `/firebase-blueprint.json`: Added `VaultFolder` (`/users/{userId}/vaultFolders/{folderId}`) and expanded `VaultDocumentMeta` (`/users/{userId}/documents/{docId}` with `folderId`, 10 `docType` categories, `storageMode`, `mimeType`, `sizeBytes` <= 50MB, `pageCount` 1..100, `expiryDate`, `issuer`, `documentNumberLast4`, bounded `tags`, `notes`, `ocrText`, `isEncrypted`, `isLocked`, `localFileKey`, `linkedReminderId`).\n    - Drafted `/DRAFT_firestore.rules`, audited via `npx eslint DRAFT_firestore.rules` (0 errors/warnings), promoted to `/firestore.rules`, deleted `/DRAFT_firestore.rules`, re-linted `firestore.rules` (0 errors/warnings), updated `/firestore.rules.test.ts` with Phase 5 Vault invariants & `vaultFolders` coverage, and deployed live via `rpc_action` (`service_name: \"fax\"`, `method_name: \"DeployRules\"` \342\200\224 succeeded).\n  - **Expo-Portable Core Domain & Unit Tests (Written, Not Yet Executed)**:\n    - `/src/core/crypto/e2eCrypto.ts`: Added `EncryptedBinaryEnvelope`, `encryptBytes`, and `decryptBytes` (AES-256-GCM binary file encryption/decryption).\n    - `/src/core/vault/vaultSchemas.ts`: Zod schemas (`VaultFolder`, `VaultDocumentMeta`, `CreateVaultFolderInput`, `CreateVaultDocumentInput`, `VAULT_DOC_TYPES`, `VAULT_DOC_TYPE_META`), cycle-safe `buildVaultFolderTree` / `flattenVaultFolderTree`, and `formatBytes`.\n    - `/src/core/vault/expiryEngine.ts`: Deterministic `evaluateDocumentExpiry` (`expired` / `critical` / `soon` / `valid` / `no_expiry`), `computeVaultSummary`, and `buildExpiryReminderInput` (creates Phase 3 Smart Reminder drafts).\n    - `/src/core/vault/pdfGenerator.ts`: Zero-dependency PDF 1.4 multi-page JPEG binary encoder (`buildMultiPagePdfFromJpegs`).\n    - `/src/core/vault/imageEnhancer.ts`: Browser canvas crop/rotate 90\302\260/enhance (`original`, `document_bw`, `vivid_color`) pipeline (`enhanceScannedImage`).\n    - `/src/core/vault/vaultEngine.test.ts`: 4 new unit tests covering expiry evaluation + reminder draft, multi-page PDF binary structure, AES-256-GCM binary encryption round-trip + Privacy Gate blocking `module: \'vault\'` on free tier, and nested Vault folder cycle neutralization + `formatBytes`.\n  - **Storage, Repositories & Hook (Written, Not Yet Compiled)**:\n    - `/src/data/storage/indexedDbVaultBinary.ts`: `VaultBinaryStorageAdapter` + `IndexedDBVaultBinaryAdapter` (`lifeos_vault_blobs_v1`, with in-memory fallback) keeping raw files local on Spark free tier ($0 billing).\n    - `/src/data/repositories/interfaces.ts`: Added `VaultRepository`.\n    - `/src/data/repositories/vaultRepository.ts`: `FirebaseWebVaultRepository` + `LocalOfflineVaultRepository` (`lifeos_local_vault_folders_v1`, `lifeos_local_vault_docs_v1`).\n    - `/src/hooks/useVault.ts`: Real-time folders & documents, IndexedDB binary save/load, session-only AES-256-GCM encrypt/decrypt (auto-wipes when `isAppLocked` activates), undo-capable delete/restore.\n  - **UI Components & App Wiring (Written, Not Yet Compiled)**:\n    - `/src/features/vault/ui/DocumentScannerModal.tsx`: File picker (Images + PDFs), live `getUserMedia` camera capture, multi-page queue, canvas Rotate 90\302\260 / Edge Crop 0\342\200\22320% / `Original` / `Doc B&W` / `Vivid` filters, multi-page PDF export option, metadata fields, and opt-in AES-256-GCM encryption toggle.\n    - `/src/features/vault/ui/VaultView.tsx`: 4-column flat KPI strip, 3-pane desktop studio (Smart Views + Nested Folders, Searchable Document List with unboxed `\302\267` metadata, Binary Viewer & Inspector with Sealed AES-256-GCM lock screen, Download, one-click `\"Schedule 30d Alert\"` wired to `useReminders()`, editable local OCR/metadata, Lock/Decrypt E2E toggle via shared `NoteSecurityModal`, and Free-Tier Privacy Gate status + `\"Verify Gate\"` button).\n    - Wired `/src/App.tsx` (`activeRoute === \'vault\'` -> `<VaultView />`), `/src/components/AppShell.tsx` (removed `phase: 5` from `vault`), `/src/features/home/ui/HomeView.tsx` (marked `vault` active, wired `useVault()` counts into KPI card & Daily Briefing), and `/src/core/i18n/i18n.ts` (updated `common.phaseReady` to Phase 5 and added complete `vault.*` EN/AR/KU translations).\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- `handleFirestoreError` and `OperationType` are exported directly from `src/data/firebase/firebaseClient.ts` (used properly in `vaultRepository.ts`).\n- `useUIStore` exposes `isAppLocked` (used properly in `useVault.ts` and fixed in `useNotes.ts`).\n- Free-tier Privacy Gate (`evaluatePrivacyGate` in `src/core/ai/privacyGate.ts`) strictly blocks `module: \'vault\'` and `containsImageOrFile: true` whenever `freeTier: true` \342\200\224 Phase 5 enforces this honestly in both code and UI, offering local searchable OCR text instead of leaking document images to free-tier cloud AI.\n- No `server.ts` changes were required for Phase 5 (all Vault binary storage, scan enhancement, PDF generation, and E2E encryption run 100% locally on-device with zero billing).\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Phase 4 `notesRepository.ts` & `plannerRepository.ts` unresolved import**: Imported `../firebase/firestoreErrors` instead of `../firebase/firebaseClient` \342\200\224 fixed.\n- **Phase 4 `notesEngine.test.ts` assertion mismatch**: Expected `PRIVACY_LOCKED_CONTENT_BLOCKED`, actual code is `BLOCKED_E2E_OR_LOCKED` \342\200\224 fixed.\n- **Phase 4 `useNotes.ts` TypeScript lint error**: Referenced `s.isLocked` instead of `s.isAppLocked` \342\200\224 fixed, `lint_applet` passed with 0 errors.\n- **Phase 5**: Zero errors so far; unit tests, compilation, linting, and live Playwright verification have not been executed yet.\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- Phase 5 `firestore.rules` are **already deployed live** via `fax.DeployRules`.\n- All Phase 5 code & wiring files are written and ready for immediate testing.\n- No temporary files or background tasks are running (`.playwright-cli` was cleaned up previously).\n\n### 6. Next Steps (Exact Priority Order to Finish Phase 5)\n1. **Run Full Unit Test Suite + First Build/Lint Check** (in parallel):\n   - Unit tests (`run_command`):\n     ```bash\n     npx tsx --test src/core/vault/vaultEngine.test.ts src/core/planner/plannerEngine.test.ts src/core/notes/notesEngine.test.ts src/core/reminders/reminderEngine.test.ts src/core/debts/debtEngine.test.ts firestore.rules.test.ts src/core/currency/currency.test.ts src/core/ai/privacyGate.test.ts src/core/entitlements/entitlements.test.ts\n     ```\n     (Should pass 36/36 tests.)\n   - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (fix any TypeScript/Vite issues immediately if found).\n2. **Live Playwright E2E + Visual Inspection**:\n   - Open `http://localhost:3000` at `1280x860` via `playwright-cli`:\n     - Clear any prior localStorage (`lifeos_local_vault_folders_v1`, `lifeos_local_vault_docs_v1`, `lifeos_local_reminders_v1`, `lifeos_local_profile_v1`) and reload.\n     - Navigate to **Vault** (`getByRole(\'button\', { name: \'Vault\' }).first().click()`).\n     - Create nested Vault folders: `Identity` -> `Passports` (`aria-label=\"New vault folder\"`, placeholder `\"Vault folder name\"`, `aria-label=\"Parent vault folder\"`, submit `\"Create\"`).\n     - Click **`Scan / Upload Document`**, generate a synthetic small PNG/JPEG in-page via `setInputFiles` (or upload a minimal PNG buffer via Playwright `setInputFiles`), verify the canvas scan preview + Rotate 90\302\260 + `Doc B&W` filter render cleanly, fill Title `\"Iraqi Passport\"`, Type `\"passport\"`, Folder `\"Passports\"`, Expiry Date 20 days from today, Issuer `\"Baghdad Directorate\"`, Last 4 `\"4821\"`, OCR text `\"Republic of Iraq Passport\"`, check `\"Export scanned pages as multi-page PDF\"`, and click **`Save to Vault`**.\n     - Verify document appears in the list with expiry warning (`Expires in 20d`), click **`Schedule 30d Alert`** and verify toast confirms reminder scheduled (`Reminder Linked`), click **`Verify Gate`** and verify Privacy Gate blocks free-tier cloud Document AI, screenshot `.playwright-cli/p5_vault_inspector.png`.\n     - Click **`Lock E2E`**, configure passphrase in `NoteSecurityModal` (`Enable AES-256-GCM` -> `I Saved My Recovery Key \302\267 Continue`), click **`Lock Session`**, verify sealed AES-256-GCM lock screen (`Unlock with Passphrase`) renders, screenshot `.playwright-cli/p5_vault_locked.png`.\n     - Navigate to **Home** and verify Vault is marked `Active` with live doc/expiring count on the KPI strip, screenshot `.playwright-cli/p5_home_active.png`.\n     - Clean up localStorage (`lifeos_local_vault_folders_v1`, `lifeos_local_vault_docs_v1`, `lifeos_local_reminders_v1`, `lifeos_local_profile_v1`) AND delete IndexedDB `lifeos_vault_blobs_v1` (`indexedDB.deleteDatabase(\'lifeos_vault_blobs_v1\')`) before closing.\n     - Check `playwright-cli console` (must have 0 errors, 0 warnings) and `playwright-cli close`.\n   - Visually inspect captured screenshots via `view_file`, fix any visual polish issues, then remove `.playwright-cli` (`rm -rf .playwright-cli`).\n3. **Final Verification Gate**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together in the same turn (and re-run unit tests if any code was edited).\n4. **Respond to User**:\n   - Present a concise, scannable summary of Phase 5 (Document Vault), remind the user to review the updated `firestore.rules`, and pause for approval (`\"Proceed to Phase 6\"` for Habits, Personal Finance, and Global AI Tool-Calling Search).\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Zero Synthetic Leftovers**: Clear both `localStorage` test keys AND IndexedDB `lifeos_vault_blobs_v1` after E2E verification.\n- **Honest Free-Tier Posture**: Keep Local-Only Vault as the $0 Spark default; clearly state Cloud Storage requires Blaze billing; keep cloud Document AI blocked when `free_tier=true`.\n- **Anti-Slop & Zero-Pill Discipline**: Unboxed `\302\267` metadata, tabular numerals (`font-numeric`), hairline single-elevation borders, logical RTL spacing (`ps-*`, `pe-*`, `text-start`, `border-s`), no thick left accent borders.\n- **Co-execute Final Build + Lint**: Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together in the final verification turn.\n- **Phased Gate**: Do NOT start Phase 6 automatically; pause after Phase 5 for user approval.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 399
    included_step_index_end: 535
