  planner_response {
    response: "**Phase 5 \342\200\224 Document Vault** is complete and verified.\n\n### What Was Built\n- **Local-Only Document Vault (Zero Blaze Billing)**: Raw document binaries stay on-device in local IndexedDB (`lifeos_vault_blobs_v1`) while structured metadata and nested folders sync through Firebase/local repositories under Spark free-tier constraints.\n- **Scan, Enhance & Multi-Page PDF Pipeline**: Built an on-device image/camera scanner with 90\302\260 rotation, edge crop (0\342\200\22320%), filter presets (`Original`, `Doc B&W`, `Vivid`), and a zero-dependency PDF 1.4 multi-page JPEG bundler.\n- **Nested Folders & Expiry Tracking**: Added cycle-safe nested Vault folders, 10 document categories (Passport, National ID, Driver\'s License, Warranty, etc.), deterministic expiry classification (`expired` / `critical` / `soon` / `valid`), and one-click **Schedule 30d Alert** integration with Phase 3 Smart Reminders.\n- **Opt-In AES-256-GCM Binary Encryption & Privacy Gate**: Extended client-side WebCrypto E2E encryption to binary files with session-only key caching (auto-wipes on app lock), a sealed preview gate, and strict Free-Tier Privacy Gate enforcement blocking cloud Document AI (`BLOCKED_FREE_TIER_VAULT_IMAGE`) while supporting local searchable OCR text.\n- **Security Rules & Dashboard Integration**: Updated and deployed hardened Firestore security rules covering `vaultFolders` and expanded `documents` schemas, added EN/AR/KU translations, and wired live Vault document/expiring counts into the Home KPI strip and Daily Briefing.\n\n### Verification\n- **Unit Tests**: 36/36 passed (including expiry engine, PDF 1.4 binary generation, AES-256-GCM binary round-trip, Privacy Gate enforcement, folder cycle safety, and Firestore rule invariants).\n- **Build & Type Check**: `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`) passed with 0 errors.\n- **Live E2E & Visual Audit**: Verified nested folders, image scan enhancement, PDF save, expiry reminder creation, Privacy Gate verification, E2E sealing, and Home sync with 0 console errors and clean test-data teardown.\n\n> **Security Review Note**: Updated `firestore.rules` have been deployed live for `vaultFolders` and `documents` \342\200\224 please review them anytime in your Firebase Console.\n\nReady for **Phase 6 (Habits, Personal Finance Ledger & Global AI Tool-Calling Search)** whenever you reply **\"Proceed to Phase 6\"** (or let me know if you\'d like any adjustments to Phase 5 first)."
    thinking: "**Verifying Immaculate Status**\n\nI\'ve got good news! The automated checks all look great. All 36 unit tests passed, and Firestore rules are deployed error-free. The Playwright E2E and visual audit checks for all Vault workflows have also come back clean. Everything is looking good, and the system is in a pristine state.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "CW4Fa_PtKOvNvdIP3uWWkQw"
    modified_response: "**Phase 5 \342\200\224 Document Vault** is complete and verified.\n\n### What Was Built\n- **Local-Only Document Vault (Zero Blaze Billing)**: Raw document binaries stay on-device in local IndexedDB (`lifeos_vault_blobs_v1`) while structured metadata and nested folders sync through Firebase/local repositories under Spark free-tier constraints.\n- **Scan, Enhance & Multi-Page PDF Pipeline**: Built an on-device image/camera scanner with 90\302\260 rotation, edge crop (0\342\200\22320%), filter presets (`Original`, `Doc B&W`, `Vivid`), and a zero-dependency PDF 1.4 multi-page JPEG bundler.\n- **Nested Folders & Expiry Tracking**: Added cycle-safe nested Vault folders, 10 document categories (Passport, National ID, Driver\'s License, Warranty, etc.), deterministic expiry classification (`expired` / `critical` / `soon` / `valid`), and one-click **Schedule 30d Alert** integration with Phase 3 Smart Reminders.\n- **Opt-In AES-256-GCM Binary Encryption & Privacy Gate**: Extended client-side WebCrypto E2E encryption to binary files with session-only key caching (auto-wipes on app lock), a sealed preview gate, and strict Free-Tier Privacy Gate enforcement blocking cloud Document AI (`BLOCKED_FREE_TIER_VAULT_IMAGE`) while supporting local searchable OCR text.\n- **Security Rules & Dashboard Integration**: Updated and deployed hardened Firestore security rules covering `vaultFolders` and expanded `documents` schemas, added EN/AR/KU translations, and wired live Vault document/expiring counts into the Home KPI strip and Daily Briefing.\n\n### Verification\n- **Unit Tests**: 36/36 passed (including expiry engine, PDF 1.4 binary generation, AES-256-GCM binary round-trip, Privacy Gate enforcement, folder cycle safety, and Firestore rule invariants).\n- **Build & Type Check**: `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`) passed with 0 errors.\n- **Live E2E & Visual Audit**: Verified nested folders, image scan enhancement, PDF save, expiry reminder creation, Privacy Gate verification, E2E sealing, and Home sync with 0 console errors and clean test-data teardown.\n\n> **Security Review Note**: Updated `firestore.rules` have been deployed live for `vaultFolders` and `documents` \342\200\224 please review them anytime in your Firebase Console.\n\nReady for **Phase 6 (Habits, Personal Finance Ledger & Global AI Tool-Calling Search)** whenever you reply **\"Proceed to Phase 6\"** (or let me know if you\'d like any adjustments to Phase 5 first)."
