  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Phase 6**\n\nI\'ve achieved complete clarity on the codebase, architecture, and security. Now, I\'m meticulously designing Phase 6, focusing on sequential execution. Currently, I\'m working on the Firestore blueprint, which I anticipate will provide a strong foundational element.\n\n\n**Refining the Firestore Blueprint**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `firebase-blueprint.json` and hardening security rules with a staged approach: DRAFT rules, ESLint audit, then final rules deployment. I am building out the structure for HabitItem with expanded fields, and adding a corresponding `HabitMonthLog` to optimize Firestore reads and writes via monthly bucketing. This also includes defining Personal Finance items.\n\n\n**Defining Personal Finance Structures**\n\nI\'m now deep in defining the data structures for Personal Finance items. This includes detailing schemas for `income` and `expense` entries, specifying fields like `amountMinor`, `currency`, `category`, and `occurredOn`. I am also working on `BudgetLimit` and `SubscriptionItem` objects, detailing attributes such as `alertThresholdPct` and `cadence`. These refinements are aimed at ensuring data integrity and optimizing for future scalability.\n\n\n**Implementing Security Measures**\n\nI\'m now implementing the Eight-Pillar rules across `habits`, `habitLogs`, `transactions`, `budgets`, and `subscriptions`, focusing on `hasAll`, `hasOnly`, `isVerifiedOwner`, `isValidId`, array bounds, immutability, version control, server timestamps, and action-based affected key restrictions. After linting with ESLint, I will promote the DRAFT rules, deploy the rules, and update tests.\n\nI\'m also working on the Expo-Portable Pure Domain Engines and Unit Tests. Currently, I\'m focused on the habits engine. Specifically, I am building out monthly bucketed check-in toggling, deterministic `computeHabitStreaks`, and a 12-week heatmap grid builder.\n\n\n**Developing Finance Functionality**\n\nI\'m now building out the finance engine. I\'ve got robust aggregation for income, expenses, and savings, including multi-currency conversions. The budget tracker and recurring subscription projection are coming together, providing spending insights. I\'m also implementing RFC-4180 CSV import/export with formula protection, ensuring data integrity. I am now working on a deterministic Break-Pattern Analyzer. I\'m focusing on the habit heatmap and analytics.\n\n\n**Building Search Capabilities**\n\nI\'m now building a deterministic offline full-text and structured search engine across all seven LifeOS modules. The focus is on clean tool functions like `search_workspace` and `get_financial_summary`. These functions will work both offline and with Gemini function calls via `/api/ai/assistant/tools`. Corresponding unit tests are in progress, particularly for habits and finance engines, validating monthly bucketing, streak calculations, multi-currency budget alerts, and CSV import/export.\n\n\n**Implementing AI Tool-Calling**\n\nI\'m now integrating Gemini AI tool-calling on the server-side, focusing on a two-phase loop for safety and data privacy. I\'m building out functions for search, financial summaries, habit consistency, and commitment projections, as well as a more advanced `propose_workspace_action` function, using structured draft JSON for safer edits.\n\n\n**Integrating Confirmation-Gated Actions**\n\nI\'m working on integrating confirmation-gated actions for Gemini tool responses, enabling read-only on-device execution with workspace state. This includes a `POST /api/ai/finance/parse` endpoint for natural-language transaction parsing and strict security checks. I\'m also adding `HabitsRepository` and `FinanceRepository` interfaces and implementing them in corresponding repository files.\n\n\n**Developing UI Updates**\n\nI\'m now focusing on UI refinements, implementing `FirebaseWeb*Repository` and `LocalOffline*Repository` for habits and finance. Real-time subscriptions and tactile feedback for habit check-ins are in progress. I\'m also adding undo capabilities for delete/restore actions and one-click reminder links for subscriptions within the habit and finance views.\n\n\n\n**Refining Financial Views**\n\nI\'m now refining the financial views. I\'m building out a tabbed workspace with Ledger, Budgets, Subscriptions, and CSV Import/Export. The Ledger will have an AI-powered natural-language parser, a manual add modal, and a high-density transaction table. Budgets will feature monthly category limits, crisp progress bars, and add/edit functionality. Subscriptions will include a recurring bill list and reminder integration. The search functionality is also being updated for all modules.\n\n\n**Implementing AI Interactions**\n\nI\'m now integrating AI interaction features, starting with a powerful command palette. It will allow me to jump directly to any module and use an **Ask AI** mode that executes real Gemini function calls over the live workspace data. The tools invoked will be displayed. This also provides the ability to **Confirm & Execute** mutations directly from the palette.\n\n\n\n"
    message_id: "PncFa8KtB6up-8YPkpuYkA0"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_11938176800469851729"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Expand HabitItem and TransactionItem and add HabitMonthLog, BudgetLimit, and SubscriptionItem entities and paths in firebase-blueprint.json\", \"EndLine\":417, \"Instruction\":\"Update HabitItem, TransactionItem, add HabitMonthLog, BudgetLimit, SubscriptionItem, and register their Firestore paths\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"    \\\"HabitItem\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"HabitItem\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Habit definition with frequency, weekly target, category, and streak counters.\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"name\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 120 },\\n        \\\"category\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"health\\\", \\\"mindfulness\\\", \\\"learning\\\", \\\"finance\\\", \\\"fitness\\\", \\\"productivity\\\", \\\"custom\\\"] },\\n        \\\"frequency\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"daily\\\", \\\"weekly\\\"] },\\n        \\\"targetPerWeek\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"reminderTime\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 5, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^([01]\\\\\\\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\\\\\\\d$\\\" },\\n        \\\"currentStreak\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"bestStreak\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"totalCompletions\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"lastCompletedDate\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 10, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^\\\\\\\\d{4}-\\\\\\\\d{2}-\\\\\\\\d{2}$\\\" },\\n        \\\"archived\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"boolean\\\" },\\n        \\\"version\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"name\\\", \\\"category\\\", \\\"frequency\\\", \\\"targetPerWeek\\\", \\\"currentStreak\\\", \\\"bestStreak\\\", \\\"totalCompletions\\\", \\\"archived\\\", \\\"version\\\", \\\"createdAt\\\", \\\"updatedAt\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"HabitMonthLog\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"HabitMonthLog\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Monthly-bucketed completion days for a habit (up to 31 YYYY-MM-DD entries per document).\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"habitId\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"monthKey\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 7, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^\\\\\\\\d{4}-\\\\\\\\d{2}$\\\" },\\n        \\\"days\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Bounded up to 31 YYYY-MM-DD completed day keys.\\\" },\\n        \\\"version\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"habitId\\\", \\\"monthKey\\\", \\\"days\\\", \\\"version\\\", \\\"createdAt\\\", \\\"updatedAt\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"TransactionItem\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"TransactionItem\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Personal finance income or expense record stored strictly in integer minor units.\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"type\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"income\\\", \\\"expense\\\"] },\\n        \\\"amountMinor\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"currency\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"IQD\\\", \\\"USD\\\", \\\"EUR\\\"] },\\n        \\\"category\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"salary\\\", \\\"freelance\\\", \\\"business\\\", \\\"gift\\\", \\\"housing\\\", \\\"food\\\", \\\"transport\\\", \\\"utilities\\\", \\\"health\\\", \\\"shopping\\\", \\\"subscriptions\\\", \\\"education\\\", \\\"entertainment\\\", \\\"debt_payment\\\", \\\"savings\\\", \\\"other\\\"] },\\n        \\\"occurredOn\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 10, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^\\\\\\\\d{4}-\\\\\\\\d{2}-\\\\\\\\d{2}$\\\" },\\n        \\\"merchant\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 120 },\\n        \\\"account\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"cash\\\", \\\"bank\\\", \\\"zaincash\\\", \\\"fib\\\", \\\"fastpay\\\", \\\"card\\\"] },\\n        \\\"note\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 500 },\\n        \\\"isRecurring\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"boolean\\\" },\\n        \\\"version\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"type\\\", \\\"amountMinor\\\", \\\"currency\\\", \\\"category\\\", \\\"occurredOn\\\", \\\"account\\\", \\\"isRecurring\\\", \\\"version\\\", \\\"createdAt\\\", \\\"updatedAt\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"BudgetLimit\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"BudgetLimit\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Monthly category spending budget in integer minor units.\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"category\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"housing\\\", \\\"food\\\", \\\"transport\\\", \\\"utilities\\\", \\\"health\\\", \\\"shopping\\\", \\\"subscriptions\\\", \\\"education\\\", \\\"entertainment\\\", \\\"debt_payment\\\", \\\"savings\\\", \\\"other\\\"] },\\n        \\\"limitMinor\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"currency\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"IQD\\\", \\\"USD\\\", \\\"EUR\\\"] },\\n        \\\"alertThresholdPct\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"version\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"category\\\", \\\"limitMinor\\\", \\\"currency\\\", \\\"alertThresholdPct\\\", \\\"version\\\", \\\"createdAt\\\", \\\"updatedAt\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"SubscriptionItem\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"SubscriptionItem\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Recurring subscription or fixed bill tracked in integer minor units.\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"name\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 120 },\\n        \\\"amountMinor\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"currency\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"IQD\\\", \\\"USD\\\", \\\"EUR\\\"] },\\n        \\\"cadence\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"weekly\\\", \\\"monthly\\\", \\\"yearly\\\"] },\\n        \\\"nextBillingDate\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 10, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^\\\\\\\\d{4}-\\\\\\\\d{2}-\\\\\\\\d{2}$\\\" },\\n        \\\"category\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"housing\\\", \\\"food\\\", \\\"transport\\\", \\\"utilities\\\", \\\"health\\\", \\\"shopping\\\", \\\"subscriptions\\\", \\\"education\\\", \\\"entertainment\\\", \\\"debt_payment\\\", \\\"savings\\\", \\\"other\\\"] },\\n        \\\"status\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"active\\\", \\\"paused\\\", \\\"cancelled\\\"] },\\n        \\\"linkedReminderId\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"note\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 500 },\\n        \\\"version\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"date-time\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"name\\\", \\\"amountMinor\\\", \\\"currency\\\", \\\"cadence\\\", \\\"nextBillingDate\\\", \\\"category\\\", \\\"status\\\", \\\"version\\\", \\\"createdAt\\\", \\\"updatedAt\\\"]\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"firestore\\\": {\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/UserProfile\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Root per-user profile, localization, theme, and privacy preferences.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/entitlements/{entitlementId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/Entitlement\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Server-managed plan limits and entitlements (read-only for client).\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/aiUsage/{dayKey}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/AiUsageDay\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Monotonic daily per-user AI quota counters.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/debtLedgers/{personKey}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/DebtLedger\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Per-person debt ledger aggregates.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/debts/{debtId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/DebtRecord\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User debt items.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/debts/{debtId}/payments/{paymentId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/DebtPayment\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Immutable append-only repayment audit entries for a specific debt.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/reminders/{reminderId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/ReminderItem\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Smart reminder items.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/tasks/{taskId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/TaskItem\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Planner task items.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/noteFolders/{folderId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/NoteFolder\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Nested note folders with optional E2E default lock.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/notes/{noteId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/NoteItem\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Notes and opt-in E2E encrypted notes.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/notes/{noteId}/versions/{versionId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/NoteVersion\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Immutable append-only note version history snapshots.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/vaultFolders/{folderId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/VaultFolder\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Nested Document Vault folders with optional E2E default lock.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/documents/{docId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/VaultDocumentMeta\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Document Vault metadata records (raw binaries stay in Local IndexedDB or private Cloud Storage).\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/habits/{habitId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/HabitItem\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Habit tracker definitions.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/habitLogs/{bucketId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/HabitMonthLog\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Monthly-bucketed habit check-in logs (30x fewer reads/writes).\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/transactions/{txId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/TransactionItem\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Personal finance income and expense ledger entries.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/budgets/{budgetId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/BudgetLimit\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Monthly category spending limits.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/subscriptions/{subId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": { \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/entities/SubscriptionItem\\\" },\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Recurring subscriptions and fixed bills.\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\", \"StartLine\":319, \"TargetContent\":\"    \\\"HabitItem\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"HabitItem\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Habit definition with streak counters.\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 128, \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\\\\\\\-]+$\\\" },\\n        \\\"name\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 1, \\\"maxLength\\\": 120 },\\n        \\\"frequency\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\