lection: ${col}`);\\n  }\\n});\", \"TargetFile\":\"/firestore.rules.test.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating firestore.rules.test.ts for Phase 6\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update firestore.rules.test.ts\"}"
