E\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:11:35Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":177404,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":194}\n{\"step_index\":514,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:22:52Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":177404,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":95}\n{\"step_index\":515,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:24:05Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":177404,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":304,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/AICommandPalette.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading AICommandPalette.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read AICommandPalette.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/features/home/ui/HomeView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading HomeView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read HomeView.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/firestore.rules.test.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading firestore.rules.test.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read firestore.rules.test.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src/core/ai\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing src/core/ai directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List src/core/ai\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":520,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:25:36Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":190953,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":174,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/core/ai/llmProvider.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading llmProvider.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read llmProvider.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/core/i18n/i18n.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"100\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading i18n.ts structure\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read i18n.ts head\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":523,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:26:09Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":195679,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":2968,\"thinking\":\"**Designing the next Phase**\\n\\nI am now focusing on Phase 6\'s core design. I\'m aiming for clean, Expo-portable engines. My current focus is hardening Firestore rules and implementing `@google/genai` Function Calling for a real server-side experience with `FunctionDeclaration`.\\n\\n\\n**Mapping the Architecture**\\n\\nMy current emphasis is on mapping the clean architecture for Phase 6, before any coding begins. I am updating my data model and security rules with new fields and collections. I\'m upgrading `HabitItem`, \\n<truncated 4183 bytes>\\nfeatures for both habit and finance operations. I\'m also planning the new 4-column KPI strip for the HabitView.\\n\\n\\n**Designing New Ledger UI**\\n\\nI\'m now fully immersed in the Ledger UI design. I\'m focusing on a flat KPI strip for monthly financial figures with dual-currency breakdowns. I\'m creating segmented tabs for Ledger, Budgets, and Subscriptions. I am upgrading the AI Command Palette to include instant local cross-module search and Gemini tool-calling assistance with a visible tool execution display.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":524,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:28:41Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":195679,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":3316,\"thinking\":\"**Defining Phase 6 Design**\\n\\nI\'m now laser-focused on designing Phase 6: the habits tracker, personal finance ledger, and global AI tool-calling search. Security is paramount, and I\'m meticulously considering an internal threat model and an architectural plan to ensure robust protection throughout this crucial development.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Firestore Schema**\\n\\nI\'m currently refining the Firestore schema. I\'m expanding `HabitItem` with various fields for categorization, tracking streaks, and visual customization.\\n<truncated 4239 bytes>\\nncome, expenses, net cash flow, and subscriptions, which I\'ll format using font-numeric formatting.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing AI Integration**\\n\\nI\'m now fully integrating the AI command palette, including live local cross-module search and an AI tool-calling assistant. I\'m focusing on user actions like \\\"Confirm Action\\\" which now creates Transactions, Habits, Tasks, or Reminders within the live repository using an instant toast. I\'ve also rewired the app components for these new features, adding them to my main UI.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":525,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:33:43Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":195679,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":134,\"thinking\":\"**Defining Phase 6 Architecture**\\n\\nI\'ve achieved full clarity on Phase 6\'s codebase and requirements! Now, I\'m focusing on architecting the **Habits Tracker, Personal Finance Ledger, and Global AI Tool-Calling Search** components with precision and thoroughness. I\'m exploring the optimal structure for each, aiming for a clean and efficient design.\\n\\n\\n\"}\n{\"step_index\":526,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:35:47Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":195679,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":831,\"thinking\":\"**Planning Phase 6**\\n\\nI\'m now deeply immersed in architecting Phase 6. I\'m focusing on the integration of the habits tracker, personal finance ledger, and global AI tool-calling search, ensuring meticulous alignment with the implementation plan, Firebase rules, Gemini API Function Calling, and the Frontend Design Constitution. I am prioritizing a design that balances robust functionality with ease of use.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Structure And Rules**\\n\\nI am currently updating the Firebase blueprint (`firebase-blueprint\\n<truncated 257 bytes>\\nwill ensure all data models are robust.\\n\\n\\n**Defining Data Models**\\n\\nI\'ve just defined the data models for transactions and budgets. I\'ve structured `/users/{userId}/transactions/{txId}` including fields like `amountMinor`, `currency`, `category`, and `paymentMethod`. I\'ve added a `BudgetItem` model as well. I\'m focusing on currency considerations. Now, I\'m working to make sure these models adhere to all the Firestore rules, including action-based update blocks and stringent restrictions on affected keys.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":527,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:38:37Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":195679,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":7352,\"thinking\":\"**Designing Phase 6**\\n\\nI\'ve achieved complete clarity on the codebase, architecture, and security. Now, I\'m meticulously designing Phase 6, focusing on sequential execution. Currently, I\'m working on the Firestore blueprint, which I anticipate will provide a strong foundational element.\\n\\n\\n**Refining the Firestore Blueprint**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on the `firebase-blueprint.json` and hardening security rules with a staged approach: DRAFT rules, ESLint audit, then final rules deployment. I am building out th\\n<truncated 4015 bytes>\\nrecurring bill list and reminder integration. The search functionality is also being updated for all modules.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing AI Interactions**\\n\\nI\'m now integrating AI interaction features, starting with a powerful command palette. It will allow me to jump directly to any module and use an **Ask AI** mode that executes real Gemini function calls over the live workspace data. The tools invoked will be displayed. This also provides the ability to **Confirm & Execute** mutations directly from the palette.\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Expand HabitItem and TransactionItem and add HabitMonthLog, BudgetLimit, and SubscriptionItem entities and paths in firebase-blueprint.json\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"417\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update HabitItem, TransactionItem, add HabitMonthLog, BudgetLimit, SubscriptionItem, and register their Firestore paths\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"    \\\\\\\"HabitItem\\\\\\\": {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"HabitItem\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Habit definition with frequency, weekly target, category, and streak counters.\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"object\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"properties\\\\\\\": {\\\\n        \\\\\\\"uid\\\\\\\": { \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"string\\\\\\n<truncated 10417 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"319\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"    \\\\\\\"HabitItem\\\\\\\": {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"HabitItem\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Habit definition with streak counters.\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"object\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"properties\\\\\\\": {\\\\n        \\\\\\\"uid\\\\\\\": { \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"minLength\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"maxLength\\\\\\\": 128,\\n<truncated 4716 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/firebase-blueprint.json\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating firebase-blueprint.json for Phase 6\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update firebase-blueprint.json with Habits & Finance schemas\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":529,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:41:46Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":205916,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":12840,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing Ruleset**\\n\\nI\'m now in the process of defining the `/DRAFT_firestore.rules` file. This includes a complete Eight-Pillar ruleset, incorporating all existing collections. I\'ve focused on hardening the validation for `habits`, `habitLogs`, `transactions`, `budgets`, and `subscriptions` with validation helpers and match blocks. The next step is auditing these rules.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"rules_version = \'2\';\\\\n\\\\nservice cloud.firestore {\\\\n  match /databases/{database}/documents {\\\\n\\\\n    // 1. Global Default-Deny Safety Net\\\\n    match /{document=**} {\\\\n      allow read, write: if false;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    // 2. Hardened Global Primitives\\\\n    fu\\n<truncated 45570 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Draft Phase 6 Eight-Pillar Firestore security rules covering habits, habitLogs, transactions, budgets, and subscriptions\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/DRAFT_firestore.rules\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Drafting Phase 6 Firestore security rules\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Write DRAFT_firestore.rules for Phase 6\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":531,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:45:16Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":218874,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":111,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"npx eslint DRAFT_firestore.rules\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Linting DRAFT_firestore.rules with Firebase ESLint\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Lint DRAFT_firestore.rules\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":533,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:47:08Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":219077,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":1715,\"thinking\":\"**Confirming Security Compliance**\\n\\nI\'m pleased to report that the linting process is complete, yielding zero errors or warnings from the security rules plugin. Now, I\'m initiating a quick internal Red Team check to scrutinize the five Phase 6 collections: `habits`, `habitLogs`, `transactions`, `budgets`. I am looking for any vulnerabilities.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"cp DRAFT_firestore.rules firestore.rules && rm -f DRAFT_firestore.rules && npx eslint firestore.rules\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Promoting and linting firestore.rules\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Promote DRAFT_firestore.rules and lint firestore.rules\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add Phase 6 Habits, HabitMonthLog, Transactions, Budgets, and Subscriptions security rule invariants to firestore.rules.test.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"67\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Assert Phase 6 helpers, bounds, and blueprint coverage in firestore.rules.test.ts\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"  assert.match(rules, /isValidVaultFolder/);\\\\n  assert.match(rules, /isValidVaultDocumentMeta/);\\\\n  assert.match(rules, /data\\\\\\\\.sizeBytes is int && data\\\\\\\\.sizeBytes >= 0 && data\\\\\\\\.sizeBytes <= 52428800/);\\\\n  assert.match(rules, /isValidHabitMonthLog/);\\\\n \\n<truncated 1771 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"33\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"  assert.match(rules, /isValidVaultFolder/);\\\\n  assert.match(rules, /isValidVaultDocumentMeta/);\\\\n  assert.match(rules, /data\\\\\\\\.sizeBytes is int && data\\\\\\\\.sizeBytes >= 0 && data\\\\\\\\.sizeBytes <= 52428800/);\\\\n});\\\\n\\\\ntest(\'firebase-blueprint.json paths are al\\n<truncated 1153 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/firestore.rules.test.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating firestore.rules.test.ts for Phase 6\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update firestore.rules.test.ts\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":536,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:48:30Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":221578,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":13202,\"thinking\":\"**Launching Deployment**\\n\\nI\'m moving forward with deploying the linted `firestore.rules` using `rpc_action`. Simultaneously, I\'m initiating the creation of the Phase 6 Expo-portable Core Domain Schemas and Pure Engines. I\'m aiming for parallel execution to optimize efficiency.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"rpc_action\",\"args\":{\"method_name\":\"\\\"DeployRules\\\"\",\"service_name\":\"\\\"fax\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Deploying Phase 6 Firestore security rules\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Deploy Phase 6 firestore.rules live\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import { z } from \'zod\';\\\\n\\\\nexport const HABIT_CATEGORIES = [\\\\n  \'health\',\\\\n  \'mindfulness\',\\\\n  \'learning\',\\\\n  \'finance\',\\\\n  \'fitness\',\\\\n  \'productivity\',\\\\n  \'custom\',\\\\n] as const;\\\\n\\\\nexport type HabitCategory = (typeof HABIT_CATEGORIES)[number];\\\\n\\\\nexpor\\n<truncated 2702 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create Expo-portable Zod schemas for Habits and monthly-bucketed HabitMonthLog\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/core/habits/habitSchemas.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating habitSchemas.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create src/core/habits/habitSchemas.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import type { HabitItem, HabitMonthLog } from \'./habitSchemas\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface HabitStreakStats {\\\\n  currentStreak: number;\\\\n  bestStreak: number;\\\\n  totalCompletions: number;\\\\n  completedToday: boolean;\\\\n  consistency30dPct: number;\\\\n  completedLast\\n<truncated 8989 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create p