  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Phase 6**\n\nI\'ve achieved a clean build and passed all unit tests. The dev server is restarted and ready. Now, I\'m initiating a Playwright end-to-end verification of Phase 6 against `http://localhost:3000`. To ensure fresh state testing, I\'m cleaning local storage for Habits and Finance before the full workflow verification.\n\n\n**Validating Feature Integration**\n\nNow I\'m diving into the Habit Tracker. I\'m creating a \"Morning Walk\" habit, checking it in for today and the past two days, and verifying the KPI updates and streak. I\'m also confirming the 84-day Heatmap capture and the weekday analysis rendering. Next, I will test the Personal Finance module to verify its features.\n\n\n"
