  planner_response {
    response: "**Phase 6 \342\200\224 Habits Tracker, Personal Finance Ledger & Global AI Tool-Calling Search** is complete and verified.\n\n### What Was Built\n- **Habits Tracker (Monthly-Bucketed Streak Engine)**:\n  - Stores completions in compact monthly buckets (`{habitId}_{YYYY-MM}` capped at 31 days) to minimize Firestore read/write cost while supporting instant offline sync.\n  - Added 4-column flat KPI strip (`Completed Today`, `Active Habits`, `Best Active Streak`, `30-Day Consistency`), 1-tap check-in with haptics & Undo, interactive 7-day quick toggles, an interactive **84-Day Consistency Heatmap**, and deterministic 8-week **Weekday Break-Pattern Analysis**.\n- **Personal Finance Ledger (Integer Minor Units & Multi-Currency IQD/USD/EUR)**:\n  - Built exact minor-unit income & expense tracking across Iraqi & international accounts (`Cash`, `Bank Account`, `ZainCash`, `FIB`, `FastPay`, `Card`) with dual-currency net cash flow and savings-rate metrics.\n  - Added **Monthly Category Budgets** with configurable alert thresholds (warning/exceeded visual indicators), **Recurring Subscriptions** with 1-click **Schedule Bill Reminder** integration into Smart Reminders, **AI Quick Entry** (EN / AR / Kurdish Sorani preview draft), and **Formula-Safe CSV Import & Export** neutralizing spreadsheet injection (`=`, `+`, `-`, `@`).\n- **Global Cross-Module Search & Gemini Function Calling Assistant**:\n  - Upgraded the `\342\214\230K` Command Palette with instant offline search across all 7 modules (`Debts`, `Reminders`, `Planner`, `Notes`, `Vault`, `Habits`, `Finance`) and module-scope filtering.\n  - Added server-side Gemini Function Calling (`/api/ai/assistant/tools`) with deterministic on-device execution of read-only workspace tools (`search_workspace`, `get_financial_snapshot`, `get_habit_consistency`, `get_upcoming_commitments`) and confirmation-gated `propose_workspace_action` execution directly into live repositories (`createTask`, `createReminder`, `createHabit`, `createTransaction`).\n  - Strictly enforces the free-tier Privacy Gate: raw Vault scans and E2E locked note contents are never exposed to cloud AI tools.\n- **Tri-Lingual RTL Support & Firestore Security Hardening**:\n  - Added English, Arabic, and Kurdish Sorani translations for Habits and Finance and activated all 7 modules across navigation and the Home Daily Briefing.\n  - Hardened and deployed live `firestore.rules` covering `habits`, `habitLogs`, `transactions`, `budgets`, and `subscriptions` with strict schema, ownership, and key-allowlist validation.\n\n### Verification\n- **Unit Tests**: 39 / 39 passing across all 6 phases (including monthly habit buckets, 84-day heatmap, break-pattern analysis, multi-currency finance minor-unit math, budget alerts, subscription burn, formula-safe CSV round-trip, cross-module privacy-gated search, and Firestore security rule invariants).\n- **Build & Type Check**: Clean `vite build`, zero `tsc --noEmit` errors, and zero ESLint issues on `firestore.rules`.\n- **Live Browser E2E & Visual Audit**: Verified Habits creation/check-ins/heatmap/break-patterns, Finance income/expense/CSV multi-currency import/budgets/subscription-to-reminder linking, Global Search & Privacy Gate blocking, and Home overview with 0 console errors.\n\n> **Security Review Note**: Updated `firestore.rules` have been deployed live for `habits`, `habitLogs`, `transactions`, `budgets`, and `subscriptions` \342\200\224 please review them anytime in your Firebase Console.\n\nAll 6 phases of the LifeOS roadmap are now live! Let me know if you\'d like any refinements, additional reports, or adjustments across any module."
    message_id: "soIFa46AJPGsz7IPpuixoQ4"
    modified_response: "**Phase 6 \342\200\224 Habits Tracker, Personal Finance Ledger & Global AI Tool-Calling Search** is complete and verified.\n\n### What Was Built\n- **Habits Tracker (Monthly-Bucketed Streak Engine)**:\n  - Stores completions in compact monthly buckets (`{habitId}_{YYYY-MM}` capped at 31 days) to minimize Firestore read/write cost while supporting instant offline sync.\n  - Added 4-column flat KPI strip (`Completed Today`, `Active Habits`, `Best Active Streak`, `30-Day Consistency`), 1-tap check-in with haptics & Undo, interactive 7-day quick toggles, an interactive **84-Day Consistency Heatmap**, and deterministic 8-week **Weekday Break-Pattern Analysis**.\n- **Personal Finance Ledger (Integer Minor Units & Multi-Currency IQD/USD/EUR)**:\n  - Built exact minor-unit income & expense tracking across Iraqi & international accounts (`Cash`, `Bank Account`, `ZainCash`, `FIB`, `FastPay`, `Card`) with dual-currency net cash flow and savings-rate metrics.\n  - Added **Monthly Category Budgets** with configurable alert thresholds (warning/exceeded visual indicators), **Recurring Subscriptions** with 1-click **Schedule Bill Reminder** integration into Smart Reminders, **AI Quick Entry** (EN / AR / Kurdish Sorani preview draft), and **Formula-Safe CSV Import & Export** neutralizing spreadsheet injection (`=`, `+`, `-`, `@`).\n- **Global Cross-Module Search & Gemini Function Calling Assistant**:\n  - Upgraded the `\342\214\230K` Command Palette with instant offline search across all 7 modules (`Debts`, `Reminders`, `Planner`, `Notes`, `Vault`, `Habits`, `Finance`) and module-scope filtering.\n  - Added server-side Gemini Function Calling (`/api/ai/assistant/tools`) with deterministic on-device execution of read-only workspace tools (`search_workspace`, `get_financial_snapshot`, `get_habit_consistency`, `get_upcoming_commitments`) and confirmation-gated `propose_workspace_action` execution directly into live repositories (`createTask`, `createReminder`, `createHabit`, `createTransaction`).\n  - Strictly enforces the free-tier Privacy Gate: raw Vault scans and E2E locked note contents are never exposed to cloud AI tools.\n- **Tri-Lingual RTL Support & Firestore Security Hardening**:\n  - Added English, Arabic, and Kurdish Sorani translations for Habits and Finance and activated all 7 modules across navigation and the Home Daily Briefing.\n  - Hardened and deployed live `firestore.rules` covering `habits`, `habitLogs`, `transactions`, `budgets`, and `subscriptions` with strict schema, ownership, and key-allowlist validation.\n\n### Verification\n- **Unit Tests**: 39 / 39 passing across all 6 phases (including monthly habit buckets, 84-day heatmap, break-pattern analysis, multi-currency finance minor-unit math, budget alerts, subscription burn, formula-safe CSV round-trip, cross-module privacy-gated search, and Firestore security rule invariants).\n- **Build & Type Check**: Clean `vite build`, zero `tsc --noEmit` errors, and zero ESLint issues on `firestore.rules`.\n- **Live Browser E2E & Visual Audit**: Verified Habits creation/check-ins/heatmap/break-patterns, Finance income/expense/CSV multi-currency import/budgets/subscription-to-reminder linking, Global Search & Privacy Gate blocking, and Home overview with 0 console errors.\n\n> **Security Review Note**: Updated `firestore.rules` have been deployed live for `habits`, `habitLogs`, `transactions`, `budgets`, and `subscriptions` \342\200\224 please review them anytime in your Firebase Console.\n\nAll 6 phases of the LifeOS roadmap are now live! Let me know if you\'d like any refinements, additional reports, or adjustments across any module."
